# game/sean12202024.rpy:121
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_0e96abb2:

    # nulln sideSean Neutral "I just sit on my bed for a moment."
    nulln sideSean Neutral "我在床上靜坐了一會兒。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:122
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_9e9e7576:

    # nulln "The weight of yesterday's investigation settled in my mind. A filled hotel with no one in it."
    nulln "昨天調查的重擔沉在我心裡。一家住滿人的旅館，裡面卻空無一人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:123
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_4a110d63:

    # nulln sideSean Quiet2 "Artificial eyes that captured their existence, yet no one to remember them. Artifacts left behind uncovered by archeologists that live in their same generation."
    nulln sideSean Quiet2 "人造之眼捕捉到了他們的存在，卻沒有活人記得他們；與他們同時代的考古學家，發掘出了被其遺留下的文物。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:124
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_127e6a7c:

    # nulln "And a hole that swallowed a chunk of the world I'm forced to call home."
    nulln "還有一個大洞，吞沒了我被迫稱為家的世界的一部分。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:125
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_45418277:

    # nulln "All kept in those walls."
    nulln "全都保存在那些牆壁裡。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:126
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_1129b32e:

    # nulln "Like a museum during the apocalypse dedicated to those who died in it."
    nulln "彷彿末日時期為了死去之人而存在的博物館。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:127
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_0b68d251:

    # nulln "Hopefully those people aren't dead."
    nulln "希望那些人還活著。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:130
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_871abf7e:

    # nulln sideSean Scared2 "I didn't even look in all the rooms I was supposed to. Yet I knew they had people in them."
    nulln sideSean Scared2 "我甚至沒有檢查所有該看的房間。不過我知道裡面有人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:131
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_3eb2fb6d:

    # nulln "I was even drawn to that bathroom, despite the feeling like I should leave it be."
    nulln "我還被那間浴室吸引住了，哪怕知道自己不該去管。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:133
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_9ff68e91:

    # nvl clear
    # nulln sideSean Sad2 "Coming back home, in general, was strange."
    nvl clear
    nulln sideSean Sad2 "回家的感覺，總的來說，很奇怪。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:135
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_2e649d93:

    # nulln "Rocco lets Arthur stay at his apartment, then he has me drive him home to his shitty parents."
    nulln "Rocco讓Arthur住他的公寓，卻又要我載他回到他糟糕的父母所在的家。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:136
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_775b41e6:

    # nulln sideSean Concerned "Was the apartment some kind of secret? I feel like that would be something he'd tell us to shut up about."
    nulln sideSean Concerned "那間公寓是要保密的嗎？感覺他會要我們對這閉口不提。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:137
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_3906385a:

    # nulln "The two beds there were also strange. Sure he could probably afford the extra, but why would he need it?"
    nulln "那裡有兩張床也很怪。他是能多買一張，但又是為什麼需要呢？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:138
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_62a3b05a:

    # nulln "He was saving for college. An extra bed is the opposite thing he needs."
    nulln "他想存錢好上大學，多買一張床根本是南轅北轍。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:139
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_1e41b399:

    # nulln "Maybe he had finally gotten close with someone, and he was embarrassed to tell us?"
    nulln "也許他終於有了對象，卻不好意思告訴我們？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:140
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_9a0c0947:

    # nulln sideSean Neutral "Either way something is up with him."
    nulln sideSean Neutral "無論如何，他肯定另有隱情。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:142
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_76b2fe88_2:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:144
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_21f7ebf2:

    # nulln "Then there was that walk."
    nulln "然後還有那次散步。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:145
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_1a3ee863:

    # nulln sideSean Sad3 "Talking to yourself can really bring out your emotions."
    nulln sideSean Sad3 "自言自語真的很容易帶出情緒。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:146
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_4b7eef1e:

    # nulln "I feel kinda like an ass for ditching Rocco though. He had been waiting since summer for Arthur and I to return."
    nulln "不過，拋下Rocco讓我覺得自己有點過分。他從夏天就一直在等我和Arthur回來。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:147
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_5e0de12a:

    # nulln "Though now that I think about it, I feel like a dick for ditching Arthur."
    nulln "不過現在想來，拋下Arthur也讓我覺得自己很過分。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:148
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_a68eeb22:

    # nulln sideSean Sad "Rocco was probably warning him about his parents finding out. Trying to make sure he doesn't end up like..."
    nulln sideSean Sad "Rocco大概是在警告他別讓父母發現，以免落得像……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:151
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_e1e60aaf:

    # nulln sideSean Concerned "Then there was what Arthur found in Rocco's bathroom."
    nulln sideSean Concerned "然後是Arthur在Rocco浴室發現的東西。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:152
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_585ebde9:

    # nulln "I know the dog hated wine..."
    nulln "我知道那隻狗討厭酒……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:153
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_33744ee2:

    # nulln sideSean Sad "I wonder if, in his loneliness, he was thinking about Casey."
    nulln sideSean Sad "但我很好奇，他感到寂寞的時候，會不會想起Casey。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:154
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_026cb925:

    # nulln "The day after his funeral, Rocco came to school with bandages wrapped around his forearms, hidden under a long sleeve shirt."
    nulln "葬禮隔天，Rocco來學校時前臂纏著繃帶，用長袖襯衫遮著。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:155
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_e356c2d4:

    # nulln "To someone just passing by it looked like it was just a shirt under his shirt. That winter was extra cold, so no one batted an eye at the extra layers."
    nulln "在路人眼裡看來，只像在襯衫裡面多穿了一件衣服。那年冬天特別冷，就算多穿一件也不足為奇。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:156
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_6c63773e:

    # nulln sideSean Quiet "I was able to get him alone."
    nulln sideSean Quiet "我私下找了他。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:157
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_c4bcca81:

    # nulln "He told me how it was a moment of weakness."
    nulln "他說我那只是一時的軟弱。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:158
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_0a0a9a26:

    # nulln "He felt so powerless and didn't know what to do."
    nulln "他感到無力，不知道該如何是好。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:159
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_bca06a71:

    # nulln "He stopped himself because he imagined me crying alone at Casey's grave."
    nulln "他沒繼續到底，是因為想像到了我獨自在Casey墓前哭泣的景象。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:160
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_66839e50:

    # nulln "Casey and I had joked about me being his brother in law,"
    nulln "Casey和我曾經開玩笑說我是他弟夫。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:161
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_76b2fe88_1:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:167
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_587fd607:

    # centered "{size=70}{color=#FFFFFF}{cps=10}but to Rocco it wasn't a joke."
    centered "{size=70}{color=#FFFFFF}{cps=10}然而對Rocco而言，那並不是個玩笑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:173
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_5193eca1:

    # narrator sideSean Quiet "I sit for a moment longer then decide to get ready for the day."
    narrator sideSean Quiet "我又坐了一會兒，才決定開始準備今天的事。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:182
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_32c889f1:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "My steps are foreign and stiff. My parent's house is exactly how I remember it, but I feel like I don't know where anything is in it."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "我的腳步生疏而僵硬。父母的房子和我記憶中完全一致，我卻感覺不知道東西擺在哪裡。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:183
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_ddfb1020:

    # "The white outside isn't strange for this time of year, but the snow feels unreal."
    "外頭的一片白在這個季節很正常，但雪感覺很不真實。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:185
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_156e333d:

    # "I spend most of the time waiting for Rocco on my phone."
    "等Rocco的時候，我大部分時間都在滑手機。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:186
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_de927f44:

    # "Mom and Dad had already left for church.{nw}"
    "媽和爸已經出門去教會了。{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:187
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_37620777:

    # narrator sideSean Quiet2 "Mom and Dad had already left for church.{fast} The last time I went with them the sermon just so happened to be on 'curing homosexuality'."
    narrator sideSean Quiet2 "媽和爸已經出門去教會了。{fast}上次我和他們一起去的時候，講道內容剛好是「治療同性戀」。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:188
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_9c80cd45:

    # "I know they didn't plan it. It was my idea, and a spur of the moment decision."
    "那當然不是他們安排的。是我一時衝動，自己提出要去的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:189
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_a018b736:

    # "I mostly wanted to go and see if I could finally visit Casey's grave."
    "主要是想去看看，是否終於能拜訪Casey的墓。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:190
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_f9552509:

    # narrator sideSean Sad "The ban still hasn't been lifted."
    narrator sideSean Sad "禁令至今未曾解除。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:202
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_11622970:

    # narrator sideSean Happy "Aside from the few times that Rocco stalls his truck, the drive to the mall is uneventful."
    narrator sideSean Happy "除了Rocco的卡車熄火了幾次，去商場的路上無事發生。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:203
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_1a328a14:

    # "The parking lot is surprisingly dead even though it's 2:00."
    "停車場出奇冷清，這都已經兩點了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:214
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_0bc0a275:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "Inside the story is mostly the same."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "裡面的情況大致相同。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:215
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_01b26ae4:

    # "Shutters are closed over many of the stores. The soft pretzel booth that Casey and I always ate at was empty."
    "許多店面的捲簾都拉上了。我和Casey以前常去吃的軟脆餅攤位空無一人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:216
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_14bb1115:

    # "The ceiling tiles were covered in stains, and buckets filled with rain water sat beneath them."
    "天花板的磁磚佈滿污漬，下面擺著接雨水的水桶。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:219
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_3d0ea939:

    # rocco "I don't remember it being this much of a shit hole."
    rocco "我不記得這裡有這麼破爛。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:222
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_773cf828:

    # arthur "Well the escape room is new. If it's all gunky it's probably for ambience."
    arthur "嗯，密室逃脫倒是新的。如果那邊也髒兮兮的，應該會是為了營造氣氛。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:225
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_0fc2478a:

    # "We meander towards the food court. I Look at the windows of the few open shops."
    "我們漫步走向美食廣場。我看著少數還開著的店面櫥窗。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:227
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_c092171d:

    # "Most are larger brand stores found in every mall. Many are new names that didn't exist ten years ago."
    "大多是每間商場都有的連鎖品牌店。很多十年前不存在的新名字。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:228
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_52b69635:

    # "We pass by a department store that had been grafted into the mall."
    "我們經過一家被接進商場的百貨公司。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:232
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_9a464957:

    # "I only gave it a passing glance, but Arthur noticed something and sprinted on in."
    "我只瞥了一眼，但Arthur注意到什麼，便衝了進去。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:233
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_763b37b4:

    # "I start to follow after the lion, but notice Rocco waiting outside."
    "我正要跟著獅子，卻注意到Rocco等在外頭。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:236
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_defd65de:

    # sean "You coming?"
    sean "你要來嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:239
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_38578ec8:

    # rocco sideSean Concerned "Nah... I'll, um, just wait outside."
    rocco sideSean Concerned "不了……我，呃，就在外面等。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:248
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_7897814b:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "I shrug and walk in after the lion. Immediately, I knew why Rocco waited outside."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "我聳聳肩，跟著獅子走進去。立馬就知道為什麼Rocco要在外面等了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:256
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_46a8acb9:

    # belle sideSean Neutral "Holy shit is that you Nora!"
    belle sideSean Neutral "我靠，是你嗎，Nora！？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:263
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_2823b1a3:

    # "The doe clops up to Arthur and gives him a big hug. The lion squeezes back and Belle lets out a little squeak."
    "母鹿蹄聲響亮地走向Arthur，給了他一個大大的擁抱。獅子回抱，讓Belle發出一小聲驚呼。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:268
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_b1d45c3b:

    # belle "Damn girl, you're strong! Must be that big ol' sax you lug around."
    belle "天啊姊妹，你力氣也太大了！肯定是因為你成天扛著那支大薩克斯風。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:270
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_f1d71bc1:

    # belle "Well how've you been? I love this look you got going, it's so fierce!"
    belle "你最近怎麼樣？我好愛你現在這個造型，超有氣勢的！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:275
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_cf4383f8:

    # arthur sideSean Embarrassed "Heh... Thanks! I umm, well I actually go by Arthur now..."
    arthur sideSean Embarrassed "嘿……謝謝！我，呃，其實現在叫Arthur了……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:279
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_0f4c0669:

    # belle "Oh...{nw}"
    belle "喔……{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:281
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_c5ea3f42:

    # belle sideSean Neutral "Oh...{fast} Are you doing that trans thing?"
    belle sideSean Neutral "喔……{fast}你是在做那個變性的事嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:285
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_eeae4622:

    # "Arthur lets out a nervous laugh. I'm about to step in, but don't as Belle continues."
    "Arthur緊張一笑。我原先正要介入，但Belle繼續說了下去。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:289
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_59b01a09:

    # belle sideSean Angry "Never thought I'd meet a tranny! That's so cool!"
    belle sideSean Angry "從來沒想過會遇到變性人！太酷了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:292
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_49a39a07:

    # belle "Oh wait, I shouldn't say that."
    belle "喔對，我不能說這種話。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:295
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_5106a239:

    # arthur sideSean Concerned "Nah it's cool..."
    arthur sideSean Concerned "沒關係啦……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:298
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_44731ed4:

    # belle sideSean Neutral "No, dude it's not cool. I'm sorry."
    belle sideSean Neutral "不行啦，這樣不好。對不起。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:303
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_3c5893b7:

    # narrator sideSean Happy "They both laugh and the tension is eased a bit."
    narrator sideSean Happy "他倆笑了出來，緊張的氣氛略有緩解。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:306
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_1c96d41f:

    # belle "Nora it's so cool that you're transitioning! Have you thought of a new name?"
    belle "Nora，你在轉變也太酷了！想過新名字了嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:310
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_a376d043:

    # arthur sideSean Embarrassed "Umm... yeah... I already told you. It's A-Arthur."
    arthur sideSean Embarrassed "呃……嗯……我已經跟你說過了。是A、Arthur。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:314
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_747f7cbc:

    # "Belle facepaws at his comment."
    "他的話令Belle雙手捂臉。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:319
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_3b37984a:

    # belle sideSean Concerned "I'm sorry. It's-"
    belle sideSean Concerned "對不起。都是——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:323
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_9821d1fc:

    # "She points to her head."
    "她指著自己的頭。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:326
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_755858bb:

    # belle "My mind."
    belle "我的腦子。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:330
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_e5c859ef:

    # arthur "Your TBI from... the stairs."
    arthur "你的創傷性腦損傷……因為那個樓梯。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:333
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_836f69fc:

    # "He says the last words with some skepticism in his tone."
    "他說最後幾個字時語氣帶著一點懷疑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:337
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_a32bddda:

    # belle "Yeah, I've been on medication from it for a few years, but it's starting to get less effective."
    belle "對，我已經吃了好幾年藥，但藥效開始變差了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:340
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_4037733d:

    # belle sideSean Neutral "I'm sorry Nor-... Archer?"
    belle sideSean Neutral "對不起，Nor……Archer？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:343
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_3a926e5c:

    # arthur "Arthur... Belle it's ok. I know it's not your fault. Let's just...{nw}"
    arthur "Arthur……沒關係啦，Belle。我知道你沒有錯。我們就……{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:346
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_8e49caea:

    # arthur sideSean Happy "Arthur... Belle it's ok. I know it's not your fault. Let's just...{fast} What's been going on?"
    arthur sideSean Happy "Arthur……沒關係啦，Belle。我知道你沒有錯。我們就……{fast}你最近怎麼樣？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:351
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_a3c3e035:

    # belle sideSean Neutral "Not much. Just kinda making money to stay alive, so I can make more money."
    belle sideSean Neutral "沒怎麼樣。就是賺點錢活下去，好賺更多錢。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:353
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_08c53d04:

    # belle "You've seen the hole right?"
    belle "你看過那個洞了吧？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:356
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_ca4404a8:

    # arthur "Yeah, it's freaky."
    arthur "對，超詭異的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:359
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_9de9d5df:

    # belle "Tell me about it. There was one night that I was standing at its edge."
    belle "可不是嗎。有一晚我站在洞邊。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:362
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_7186bfa1:

    # belle sideSean Scared "I think I heard something, or saw something. I don't remember."
    belle sideSean Scared "好像聽見或看見了什麼。記不清楚了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:363
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_2249b691:

    # belle "Anyway I just booked it from there back to my parent's house."
    belle "當下我直接衝回父母家了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:368
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_5b4e9776:

    # sean sideSean Concerned "You're still in Carthage?"
    sean sideSean Concerned "你還住在迦太基？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:372
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_a8520558:

    # belle sideSean Sad2 "Have to. My doc said that I shouldn't live alone, so for now I have to stay with my folks."
    belle sideSean Sad2 "沒辦法。醫生說我不該一個人住，所以暫時得跟家人住。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:377
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_317ee1c1:

    # arthur sideSean Neutral "Well we're in town for the next month! You can come hang out with us!"
    arthur sideSean Neutral "我們這個月都會在鎮上！你可以來找我們玩！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:382
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_146244a5:

    # sean "I, uh... Don't wanna ditch Rocco."
    sean "我，呃……不想拋下Rocco。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:385
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_f16f7ad3:

    # belle "It's fine Sean. I've moved on."
    belle "沒事，Sean。我已經放下了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:389
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_ecc33280:

    # sean "I don't think he has."
    sean "但他恐怕還沒。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:393
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_20126dd3:

    # "I point out the glass front. The dog has sat himself on a bench, and is scrolling through his phone."
    "我指著玻璃門外面。狗正坐在長椅上滑手機。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:394
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_459e63b6:

    # "Thankfully he doesn't look up at us. Belle rolls her eyes."
    "幸好他沒抬頭看我們。Belle翻了個白眼。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:398
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_c0de1e2d:

    # belle sideSean Concerned "We were young, and while I can't forgive him for what he did; I can at least move past it."
    belle sideSean Concerned "我們那時還年輕。我是無法原諒他做的事，但至少可以往前看。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:401
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_d767c83c:

    # "My mind reflexively wants to interrogate that part, but I hold myself back."
    "我反射性想追問那部分，不過忍住了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:402
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_77d31d6e:

    # "This isn't the place to be getting into the distant past. Belle's moved on so there's no reason to open scarred wounds."
    "這裡不是翻舊帳的地方。Belle已經放下了，沒必要再撕開結疤的傷口。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:407
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_0f76b689:

    # arthur sideSean Neutral "So when do you get off work?"
    arthur sideSean Neutral "那你幾點下班？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:412
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_16d00f04:

    # belle "Not until seven. I'll be tired so I think I'm just gonna go home and sleep."
    belle "要到七點。我會很累，大概要直接回家睡覺。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:415
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_15525590:

    # arthur "Fair... Well we're doing an escape room at four. Want us to wait around for you?"
    arthur "好吧……我們四點要去密室逃脫。要我們等你嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:420
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_75ffe4d2:

    # belle "Nah it's fine. Nice catching up with you!"
    belle "不用了。很高興能跟你們敘舊！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:423
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_050aeeee:

    # arthur "Same here!"
    arthur "我也是！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:426
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_fc616559:

    # belle "Oh, before I forget again!"
    belle "喔對，趁我還記得！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:429
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_22ce9c58:

    # "She whips out her phone and begins typing."
    "她拿出手機打字。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:434
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_1a6ee7b4:

    # belle "Artie?"
    belle "Artie？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:437
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_65f6c55a:

    # arthur "Just Arthur please."
    arthur "Arthur就夠了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:442
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_8a4ff2ae:

    # belle sideSean Happy "Gotcha! Well this will help me remember."
    belle sideSean Happy "行！這能幫我記住。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:445
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_1fd12eb3:

    # "She taps the side of the case. We all laugh a bit, and then say our goodbyes."
    "她敲了敲手機殼側邊。我們都笑了一下，然後道別。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:446
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_0ca60f88:

    # "There's a new found pep in Arthur's step that I've missed seeing. His gait is bouncy and his smile is infectious."
    "Arthur的步伐多了一股我很久沒見到的活力，走路輕快，笑容很有感染力。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:466
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_be122ea1:

    # narrator sideSean Happy "We make our way back to our dog friend. His tail's wagging as we approach him."
    narrator sideSean Happy "我們走回狗朋友身邊。一靠近，他尾巴就搖個不停。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:469
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_1fc35280:

    # rocco "So how's she doin?"
    rocco "所以她怎麼樣？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:472
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_d311e8d7:

    # arthur "Good... Good...{nw}"
    arthur "不錯……不錯……{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:473
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_4d54e5b7:

    # arthur sideSean Neutral "Good... Good...{fast} Memory thing caused her to dead name me, but I know she doesn't mean anything by it."
    arthur sideSean Neutral "不錯……不錯……{fast}她因為記憶問題錯叫了我的死名，但我知道她不是故意的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:477
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_86a8f991:

    # rocco "Well, we still have an hour and a half till the escape room.{nw}"
    rocco "嗯，離密室逃脫還有一個半小時。{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:479
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_f138ba31:

    # rocco "Well, we still have an hour and a half till the escape room.{fast} Lunch?"
    rocco "嗯，離密室逃脫還有一個半小時。{fast}要吃午餐嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:482
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_1b87b5e9:

    # sean sideSean Happy "Sure."
    sean sideSean Happy "好啊。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:486
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_b4ea7ca4:

    # arthur "Please! I am starving!"
    arthur "一定要！我快餓死了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:500
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_c3c17f30:

    # narrator sideSean Happy "The food court isn't as empty as the rest of the mall."
    narrator sideSean Happy "美食廣場不像其他地方那麼空。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:502
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_9cd08bf6:

    # "A lion, hairless cat, and crow sit at one table. A hyena, cheetah, dog and raccoon are at another."
    "一張桌子坐著獅子、無毛貓和烏鴉。另一張坐著鬣狗、獵豹、狗和浣熊。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:504
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_f61736c9:

    # "Along the wall various restaurants sit with employees as dead as the mall. The aromas drifting off of them compete for dominance in my nose."
    "各種餐廳沿牆排列，員工和商場一樣死氣沉沉。飄出的香氣在我鼻子裡爭奪主導權。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:518
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_1911733b:

    # "Rocco walks off, probably to get the aforementioned pizza. I turn to follow him and spot a familiar bat at the counter."
    "Rocco走離，大概是要買之前提過的披薩。我轉身跟著他，便看到櫃檯有位眼熟的蝙蝠。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:523
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_54bb176a:

    # claire "Oh hey guys!"
    claire "你們好啊！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:526
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_86785182:

    # rocco "Sup!"
    rocco "嗨！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:529
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_9dad429b:

    # "Rocco's tail begins to wag."
    "Rocco尾巴搖動。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:534
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_1e28bdd6:

    # claire "Lake these were the guys I was telling you about."
    claire "Lake，他們就是我跟你提過的人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:537
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_a8a40109:

    # "Behind the counter an androgynous hyena stands. Their gray, sauce stained apron, contrasts their neon green hair and gold piercings. They extend a paw out and we shake it."
    "櫃檯後方站著一隻中性氣質的鬣狗。沾滿醬汁的灰圍裙和TA螢光綠的髮色與金色穿環形成對比。TA伸出爪子，和我們握手。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:540
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_fd6ab1b3:

    # lake "Lake, but Claire already spoiled it. You here to order something, or didja wanna talk to her?"
    lake "我叫Lake，不過Claire剛才先說了。你們是來點餐的，還是想跟她說話？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:543
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_9d44af2a:

    # rocco "Just three slices, one meat-lovers, one pepperoni, and one uuh, let's make it two meat lovers."
    rocco "就三片，一片肉多多、一片義式香腸，然後、呃……改成兩片肉多多好了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:549
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_bd74846f:

    # lake "Commin' up boss."
    lake "馬上來，老闆。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:555
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_f7911e8f:

    # "Lake takes the slices and throws them in the oven to warm up."
    "Lake拿起披薩片丟進烤箱加熱。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:559
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_b05417e6:

    # claire sideSean Neutral "I was telling Lake and Hailey about the investigation."
    claire sideSean Neutral "我在跟Lake和Hailey講調查的事。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:568
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_fa9527d8:

    # "As if on queue, a bird walks out from the next door noodle stand,{nw}"
    "恰巧，一隻鳥從隔壁拉麵攤走出來，{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:570
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_5df52673:

    # "As if on queue, a bird walks out from the next door noodle stand,{fast} and gives Claire a peck on the cheek."
    "恰巧，一隻鳥從隔壁拉麵攤走出來，{fast}在Claire臉頰上啄了一下。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:575
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_8581d933:

    # "They look back at us, and then whisper something to Claire. She whispers something back, and the bird turns to look at us."
    "TA回望我們，然後向Claire耳語。對方也回了幾句後，鳥轉身面向我們。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:580
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_0208734d:

    # whomst "H-hello... I'm um... tired-{nw}"
    whomst "你、你們好……我是、呃……好累——{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:583
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_c521e1c3:

    # whomst "H-hello... I'm um... tired-{fast} I MEAN{nw}"
    whomst "你、你們好……我是、呃……好累——{fast}{b}我是說{/b}{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:584
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_5a98cc7a:

    # hailey "H-hello... I'm um... tired- I MEAN{fast} HAILEY!"
    hailey "你、你們好……我是、呃……好累——{b}我是說{/b}{fast}HAILEY！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:587
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_0205febd:

    # narrator sideSean Concerned "Claire chuckles as Hailey's feathers poof out. Kinda reminds me of myself a few years ago."
    narrator sideSean Concerned "Hailey的羽毛都炸開了，Claire輕笑出聲。感覺有點像幾年前的我。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:597
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_9a648887:

    # narrator sideSean Happy "We introduce ourselves as Lake pulls the pizzas out of the oven. Rocco pays for the slices, and the five of us head over to a table to chat."
    narrator sideSean Happy "Lake在我們自我介紹時將披薩從烤箱拿出。Rocco付了錢後，我們五人走到一張桌邊聊天。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:602
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_5abd2b94:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "We tell Hailey about what we found in the hotel. Well... more like what we didn't find."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "我們跟Hailey講了在旅館發現的事物。嗯……應該說沒找到的事物。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:605
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_f755ce02:

    # hailey "It is a weird coincidence. And no one's turned up?"
    hailey "這巧合挺詭異的。而且沒有人現身？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:608
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_4790b832:

    # rocco "Not from what I've heard. Unless someone's keeping me out of the loop."
    rocco "據我所知沒有。除非有人把我排除在消息外。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:612
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_6e9c7ec9:

    # hailey "Those white eyes were creepy. Do you think they have anything to do with the disappearances?"
    hailey "那些白眼睛好恐怖喔。你們覺得跟失蹤案有關嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:616
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_ca10e8c2:

    # arthur sideSean Concerned "If there's a monster down there I wanna see it!"
    arthur sideSean Concerned "要是底下有怪物，我想看看！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:621
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_6104dcae:

    # rocco sideSean Neutral "The moment it spots you it'll probably start running away."
    rocco sideSean Neutral "怕是會被你直接嚇跑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:626
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_fca7a2cd:

    # hailey "You are giving off an intense aura."
    hailey "你散發的氣場太強烈了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:630
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_7c3404f9:

    # claire "It is weird that it didn't come out."
    claire "它沒跑出來還挺怪的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:637
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_f348a922:

    # hailey sideSean Happy "It probably sensed you!"
    hailey sideSean Happy "大概是察覺到你了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:640
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_36033a1d:

    # "We all laugh at that."
    "我們都因此笑了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:643
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_e344fd39:

    # arthur "Nah I was miles away. Out of town for college."
    arthur "沒，我那時在好幾英里外。大學不在鎮上。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:648
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_2980abac:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "We tell them about our degrees. Rocco gets a little embarrassed being the only one not going to college."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "我們聊著學位。Rocco是唯一沒上大學的人，顯得有些尷尬。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:649
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_17333b13:

    # narrator sideSean Concerned "Thankfully we don't spend much time on our academics."
    narrator sideSean Concerned "所幸我們沒在學業上琢磨太多時間。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:656
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_7e1b5498:

    # claire sideSean Neutral "I did my own digging through the files. I still had an hour left after writing my report and nothing better to do."
    claire sideSean Neutral "我自己翻過檔案。畢竟寫完報告後還剩一小時，也沒什麼其他事好做的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:659
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_d0d9a10e:

    # "Claire paws us her phone with a note document open."
    "Claire把手機推給我們，上面開著筆記文件。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:666
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_b4a87dea:

    # claire sideSean Concerned "Rocco do you remember a P.I. or a cop coming in to talk to someone?"
    claire sideSean Concerned "Rocco，你記得有私家偵探或警察來跟人談話嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:669
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_25b4f964:

    # "The dog looks up at her. By his face alone we know what he's going to say."
    "狗抬頭看她。光看他的表情，我們就料他的回答了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:672
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_761589c7:

    # rocco "No one mentioned it."
    rocco "沒人提過。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:677
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_d9b10e2a:

    # claire "Do you know about a tabby working at the hotel? The employee files I looked at only have names, and I don't plan on breaching privacy any more than that."
    claire "你知道旅館有隻虎斑貓員工嗎？我看的員工檔案只有名字，我也不打算再進一步侵犯隱私。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:681
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_fc478d7d:

    # rocco "You have access to-{nw}"
    rocco "你有權限看——{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:683
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_9ac3a8b5:

    # rocco sideSean Quiet2 "You have access to-{fast} never mind. No, there isn't a tabby that works at the hotel. I wouldn-"
    rocco sideSean Quiet2 "你有權限看——{fast}算了。沒，旅館沒有虎斑貓員工。我不會——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:687
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_5cf139d9:

    # "He cuts himself off."
    "他突然停住。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:691
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_7df958fb:

    # rocco "Fuck this I just want to have a normal day off!"
    rocco "我操，我只不過想好好休個假！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:698
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_8ebd6191:

    # arthur sideSean Concerned "Sean and I... um... found something."
    arthur sideSean Concerned "Sean和我……呃……有一些發現。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:701
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_a1d542e5:

    # narrator sideSean Embarrassed "They look at us. Then Arthur looks at me. I feel myself shrink in the seat."
    narrator sideSean Embarrassed "他們望了過來，然後Arthur看向我。我在座位上縮了一下。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:705
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_e446a1e9:

    # sean "You brought it up..."
    sean "是你提的……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:709
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_4a962085:

    # narrator sideSean Quiet2 "Thankfully the deflection works and now everyone is staring at Arthur."
    narrator sideSean Quiet2 "好在轉移焦點成功，現在所有人都盯著Arthur。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:713
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_ecc2d591:

    # arthur "Well... We checked out Sarah Anderson's room."
    arthur "嗯……我們查了Sarah Anderson的房間。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:715
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_15c98b2a:

    # arthur "I think it was 105?"
    arthur "我記得是105號房？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:717
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_0714189a:

    # arthur sideSean Sad "There was a voice recorder in it with some... pretty damning stuff. She said an investigator came by to follow up on her assault report."
    arthur sideSean Sad "裡面有一台錄音機，錄了一些……很操蛋的內容。她說有個調查員來跟進她的性侵案。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:718
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_81e0eb8a:

    # arthur "She didn't remember being assaulted or filing a report."
    arthur "她卻不記得自己被性侵過，也不記得報過案。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:719
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_86ce80d9:

    # arthur "When the investigator gave her the name of the assaulter. She didn't know who it was."
    arthur "當調查員告訴她施暴者的名字時，她不知道那是誰。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:722
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_29ed5397:

    # narrator sideSean Embarrassed "Great, now everyone's eyes are back on me. I nibble away at my slice of pizza, nodding."
    narrator sideSean Embarrassed "真棒，大家的目光又回到我身上了。我邊啃披薩邊點頭。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:723
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_b73b8740:

    # narrator sideSean Concerned "Thankfully that's enough of a yes for the group."
    narrator sideSean Concerned "對大夥來說，這就足夠表示肯定了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:730
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_95fe1469:

    # rocco "Fuck me."
    rocco "我操。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:737
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_d982df44:

    # arthur sideSean Neutral "We didn't bring it up yesterday, because it wouldn't be a good idea to have Mr. Bara-Bod approach someone who had just been assaulted."
    arthur sideSean Neutral "我們昨天沒提，畢竟讓肉壯男接近剛被性侵的人也不太好。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:742
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_beb8e25b:

    # "Rocco self-consciously begins looking over his body."
    "Rocco不太自在地打量起自己的身體。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:743
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_eee999ab:

    # "I get close to the crust of my slice, fold the remaining cheese and sauce over it, and begin eating away at the pizza taco."
    "我披薩吃到接近餅皮，把剩下的起司和醬料折起來，當成捲餅吃。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:750
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_f164adcf:

    # sean "Plus the cops are already on it."
    sean "而且警察已經在處理了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:754
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_880c365d:

    # narrator sideSean Trauma "Claire, Hailey, and Arthur give me a look. I can't help but slide down in my chair a bit more."
    narrator sideSean Trauma "Claire、Hailey和Arthur瞥了我一眼。我又不禁在椅子上滑低了點。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:757
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_6fe42d96:

    # claire "You really think the cops are gonna do anything."
    claire "你真覺得警察會做什麼事嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:760
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_1e72e833:

    # sean sideSean Embarrassed "No?"
    sean sideSean Embarrassed "不會嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:766
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_9ad873fb:

    # hailey sideSean Concerned "If anything, they're just gonna let the guy go with a stern talking to."
    hailey sideSean Concerned "頂多也就教訓那人一頓後就放他走人了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:769
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_0ded5028:

    # "There's a venom to Hailey's words. One that I didn't expect from the shy bird."
    "Hailey語氣憤恨。沒想到會從這隻靦腆的鳥口中聽到。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:772
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_8218afd5:

    # claire "I wish there was more we can do."
    claire "真希望有更多我們能做的事。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:778
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_1fa7c95e:

    # rocco sideSean Neutral "Sometimes the best thing to do is nothing. People get paid to look into shit like this."
    rocco sideSean Neutral "有時候最好什麼都別做。這種事有人會專門拿錢來辦的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:779
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_b07dcef6:

    # rocco "Having a gang of misfits playing investigator will probably fuck something up."
    rocco "讓一群局外人來玩偵探遊戲，大概只會幫倒忙。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:782
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_c3ca21e0:

    # narrator sideSean Embarrassed "I think that was supposed to make us feel better."
    narrator sideSean Embarrassed "他這麼說，應該是要讓我們心理好過一點。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:785
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_a6ac1d85:

    # claire sideSean Neutral "The main thing was the investigator and the staff member."
    claire sideSean Neutral "重點是那個調查員和員工。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:787
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_061efc94:

    # claire "The fact that you don't know either of them makes me concerned."
    claire "你們全都不認識，讓我很擔心。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:790
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_fd52569e:

    # claire sideSean Concerned "Is there any way I could convince the three of you and Hank to move out for a bit? At least until this mystery is over."
    claire sideSean Concerned "你們三個和Hank能暫時搬走嗎？至少等到這個謎團事件結束。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:794
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_02b4bef6:

    # "We all give Claire a concerned look."
    "我們都擔憂地看向Claire。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:797
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_31abf6e0:

    # claire "I know we only met yesterday, but something is wrong with that town."
    claire "我們確實昨天才剛認識，但那個小鎮有問題。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:798
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_55a3b202:

    # claire "I'm worried you all are going to go missing and I won't remember."
    claire "我很怕你們都會鬧失蹤，而我卻不記得了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:801
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_7e140c46:

    # sean sideSean Neutral "What makes you say that?"
    sean sideSean Neutral "怎麼這麼說？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:813
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_936a8be7:

    # claire "Remember how we said we ran into someone?"
    claire "還記得我們說有碰到一個人嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:816
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_b5dd7587:

    # sean sideSean Scrutinizing "Sure?"
    sean sideSean Scrutinizing "那怎麼了？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:819
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_38290759:

    # claire sideSean Embarrassed "What was their name Sean?"
    claire sideSean Embarrassed "那個人叫什麼名字，Sean？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:823
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_302da091:

    # "I don't remember, and I think Claire can see that."
    "我不記得了，我想Claire也看得出來。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:824
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_da2d8b01:

    # "In fact, now that I think about it, we didn't run into anyone yesterday."
    "事實上，現在想來，我們昨天根本沒碰見任何人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:830
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_251747a2:

    # claire sideSean Scared "What was their species Sean?"
    claire sideSean Scared "那個人種族是什麼，Sean？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:834
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_abe7fd90:

    # "We didn't run into anyone yesterday, and Claire can see it on my face."
    "我們昨天沒碰到任何人，Claire從我表情看出來了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:837
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_e1d8effb:

    # claire "We wouldn't pay it any mind if we weren't talking about it right now."
    claire "要不是現在在談這事，我們根本不會去在意。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:838
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_2967d515:

    # claire "Hell, I wrote it down in my report, and almost erased it because I thought I was lying."
    claire "靠，我都寫進了報告裡，還差點因為覺得自己在虛假報告而刪掉。"

