translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_02ca3a7a:

    # claire "We just forgot a person existed, and we didn't pay it a second thought!"
    claire "我們就這樣忘了有個人存在過，連想都沒多想！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:843
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_035c57ca:

    # "Rocco gives me a sympathetic look."
    "Rocco同情地看了我一眼。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:844
