    # "We don't say anything and the noise of the food court fills our ears."
    "我們默默無言，美食廣場的噪音充斥耳朵。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:851
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_9ee9773f:

    # claire "Remember how you said you ran into someone?"
    claire "還記得你說有碰到一個人嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:854
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_b5dd7587_1:

    # sean sideSean Scrutinizing "Sure?"
    sean sideSean Scrutinizing "怎麼了？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:857
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_38290759_1:

    # claire sideSean Embarrassed "What was their name Sean?"
    claire sideSean Embarrassed "那個人叫什麼名字，Sean？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:863
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_302da091_1:

    # "I don't remember, and I think Claire can see that."
    "我不記得了，我想Claire也看得出來。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:864
translate Tchinese sean12202024kc_691e1bcd:

    # "In fact, now that I think about it, [hp1stUpper] and I didn't run into anyone yesterday."
    "事實上，現在想來，我和[hp1stUpper]昨天根本沒碰見任何人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:870
