    # rocco sideSean Neutral "Oh shit, we should get going soon."
    rocco sideSean Neutral "喔靠，我們該走了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3418
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_ed2c7062:

    # cody Happy "Right, our escape room opens in thirty minutes."
    cody Happy "對，我們半小時後有密室逃脫。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3423
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_a3cc1280:

    # hailey "Oh, are you trying out that new place?"
    hailey "哦，你們要去試那家新的嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3427
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_8615df7b:

    # rocco "Yeah, they had a deal going on for their new room. Cody what was it called?"
    rocco "對，他們的新房間有優惠。是叫什麼來著，Cody？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3430
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_a8b84738:

    # cody "Password. It's based off of a book with the same name."
    cody "Password。改編自同名書。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3433
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_c75b42ee:

    # sean Neutral "They'll probably want us there early to sign papers or something."
    sean Neutral "我們應該得提早到場填資料之類的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3439
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_d4f57dc9:

    # hailey "It is on the other side of the mall."
    hailey "他們在商場另一端。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3442
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_35f56b0e:

    # claire "Well we can table the conversation and talk more later.{nw}"
    claire "那這話題就之後再聊吧。{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3447
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_34129e88:

    # claire Happy "Well we can table the conversation and talk more later.{fast} Have fun guys!"
    claire Happy "那這話題就之後再聊吧。{fast}祝你們玩得開心！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3450
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_7efc45e8:

    # "We say our goodbyes and start walking to the escape room."
    "我們道別後，走向密室逃脫。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3462
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_d60a3401:

    # narrator sideSean Happy "FairView Navigators, not a name I would've picked."
    narrator sideSean Happy "FairView Navigators，我是不會選這名字啦。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3473
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_a6754a80:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "We walk inside and are greeted by a black rat with red eyes asleep at the front desk."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "我們走進去，看到一隻紅眼的黑老鼠睡在前台。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3474
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_8e51eab6:

    # "Rocco walks over to him. He slowly wakes up, and hands him some papers."
    "Rocco走向他。他緩緩醒來，遞給他幾張紙。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3475
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_be387c0a:

    # "As we all began filling out the forms for the escape room I could see him sneak in an extra minute of napping."
    "我們填密室逃脫的資料時，他又貪了點睡。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3477
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_39035f4d:

    # "Once we're done, he walks us down a hallway to a fairly modern door and some lockers."
    "填完後，他帶我們穿過其他密室逃脫房間的走廊，來到一扇相當現代的門和一些置物櫃前。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3479
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_48b18e06:

    # whomst "Alright, put your phones and any valuables in the lockers behind me. Have you guys done Password before?"
    whomst "好了，把手機和貴重物品放到我後面的置物櫃裡吧。你們以前玩過Password嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3481
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_a6c17f88:

    # "We shake our heads no, and the rat sighs."
    "我們搖頭表示沒有，老鼠嘆了口氣。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3483
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_281e82cb:

    # whomst "For the sake of the room you can call me Thanatos."
    whomst "以這個房間的設定，你們可以叫我Thanatos。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3484
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_bd1a2c64:

    # thanatos "You all have won a sweepstakes vacation to the esteemed Hammond estate."
    thanatos "你們靠抽獎贏得了假期，來到尊貴的Hammond莊園。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3485
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_bf90eca4:

    # thanatos "It has everything you could need, and a strange vault in its basement."
    thanatos "這裡應有盡有，地下室還有一個奇怪的金庫。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3487
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_1c94598c:

    # "He tries his best to have some energy to the exposition, but we can all tell he wants to get back to sleep."
    "他盡力打起精神解說，但我們都看得出他只想再回去睡。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3489
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_5de62c56:

    # thanatos "After a few days of staying in the manor you suddenly get sick. Over the next hour it gets worse and worse until you die."
    thanatos "在莊園住了幾天後，你們突然生了病。接下來的一小時內，你們病情會越來越嚴重，最後死掉。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3490
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_53757fd8:

    # thanatos "You awake an hour earlier remembering everything that's about to happen to you."
    thanatos "你們提前一小時醒來，還記得即將發生的一切。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3491
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_1e61bfd3:

    # thanatos "Something strange is going on in this house, and you have a feeling that the basement's vault has what you need to survive the day."
    thanatos "這間房子裡有怪事發生，而你們覺得地下室的金庫裡，會有什麼東西能幫你們撐過這一天。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3493
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_8fa9d6af:

    # "He lets out an exhausted sigh."
    "他發出疲憊的嘆息。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3495
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_6c86be08:

    # thanatos "Once I close the door you'll be locked in the room for the next hour. If you need to go to the bathroom it's down the hall and to the right."
    thanatos "我關上門後，你們會被鎖在房間裡一小時。如果要上廁所，走廊盡頭右轉。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3496
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_7dbef221:

    # thanatos "In the event of any emergencies, or you need to leave the room for whatever reason just let me know. I'll be listening in so I can come and unlock it for you."
    thanatos "如果發生任何緊急情況，或因故需要離開房間，就跟我說一聲。我會聽著你們的動靜，能幫忙解鎖。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3497
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_49dcefed:

    # thanatos "I'll also be your source of hints. Walk up to the monitor by the front door and say the phrase 'give me a vision'."
    thanatos "我也會給你們提示。走到前門的螢幕前說「給我一個幻象」。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3498
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_0c53068a:

    # thanatos "You have unlimited hints so don't be afraid to use them if you get stuck."
    thanatos "提示是無限的，卡關的時候直接用就行。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3500
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_fdaec0f1:

    # "None of us have to pee so we all enter the room. The door makes an audible click as we're locked in the room."
    "沒人要上廁所，就全都進了房間。門發出響亮的咔噠聲，把我們鎖在裡面。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3520
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_a1692d82:

    # rocco sideSean Happy "Man I'm starving!"
    rocco sideSean Happy "天啊，我快餓死了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3523
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_5a6f3fa6:

    # cody "Me too... I'm so hungry I could eat a-"
    cody "我也是……餓到能吃下一頭——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3535
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_e69b08d7:

    # sean Neutral "So what're we thinking for dinner?"
    sean Neutral "那晚餐要吃什麼？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3540
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_857a6485:

    # cody "I haven't been to Baxter's in years! We could go there."
    cody "我好幾年沒去Baxter了！可以去那裡。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3543
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_22bbbb9f:

    # "I see the hint of drool start to leak from Rocco's mouth."
    "Rocco嘴角滲出口水。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3548
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_dbfe7b0c:

    # nulln Quiet "I honestly didn't want to go."
    nulln Quiet "老實說，我並不想去。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3551
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_77ec9af9:

    # nulln "Casey would beg us to eat at Baxter's."
    nulln "以前Casey會求我們去Baxter吃。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3553
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_700178ce:

    # nulln "Every time we went to see a movie, or hang out at the mall, we would end our trip there."
    nulln "每次我們去看電影或逛商場，總會在那收尾。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3558
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_6e643b8c:

    # nulln Sad "A root beer, pulled pork with onion straws, and extra fries to take home was his order."
    nulln Sad "一杯沙士、手撕豬肉配洋蔥絲，再加份薯條外帶，就是他的點單。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3559
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_c54e8c04:

    # nulln "He never tried anything else on the menu because he already found the perfect item."
    nulln "他從不點菜單上的其他品項，因為他已經有了完美套餐。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3563
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_76b2fe88_5:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3573
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_dfdb3c26:

    # nulln sideSean Quiet "Baxter's was one of the last places we took Casey."
    nulln sideSean Quiet "Baxter是我們最後帶Casey去的地方之一。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3574
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_e0ffaf70:

    # nulln "Rocco thought that maybe seeing a movie and eating there would help improve his mood."
    nulln "Rocco覺得，一起看電影後再去Baxter吃飯，興許能改善他的心情。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3575
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_ac3e86b9:

    # nulln Sad "I remember him telling me that Casey would get home, do his homework, and then go to sleep."
    nulln Sad "我還記得，他說Casey回家後會寫功課，然後就睡覺。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3576
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_85941412:

    # nulln "He only left their room to eat dinner, and even then, he never spoke at the table."
    nulln "只有在吃晚餐時才離開房間，即便如此，也從不在飯桌上說話。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3588
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_131d23e4:

    # nulln sideSean Quiet "That day was the first real time I saw Casey after camp."
    nulln sideSean Quiet "那天是矯正營後我第一次真正見到Casey。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3589
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_a3e733ea:

    # nulln "His eyes were sunken, his posture closed off, and his clothes no longer fit him."
    nulln "他雙眼凹陷、姿勢封閉，衣服也不再合身。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3590
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_7247379f:

    # nulln "He touched a paw rail once and screamed from the static shock..."
    nulln "他碰了一次扶手，被靜電嚇到尖叫……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3591
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_587ef5d8:

    # nulln "He avoided rails and opening doors for the rest of the day."
    nulln "然後一整天都避開扶手或開門。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3614
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_d344a50e:

    # nvl clear
    # nulln "He ordered his usual."
    nvl clear
    nulln "他點了老樣子。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3616
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_6fc2fca4:

    # nulln "I looked over at him and I could see it."
    nulln "我看向他，看得出來："

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3617
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_5629ee54:

    # nulln "Only one bite and he wanted to leave."
    nulln "他只吃了一口，就想走了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3618
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_81264c9e:

    # nulln "To be anywhere other than here."
    nulln "只要能離開這裡，去哪都好。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3619
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_4e4af545:

    # nulln "His body had locked up."
    nulln "他的身體僵住了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3620
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_6005b842:

    # nulln "He stared at his food for the rest of the meal."
    nulln "其餘的用餐時間，他只是盯著自己的食物。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3621
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_ce186576:

    # nulln "Not saying anything or looking at anyone."
    nulln "什麼都不說，也不看別人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3622
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_9186a830:

    # nvl clear
    # nulln "I thought about putting a paw on his, but didn't."
    nvl clear
    nulln "我想過把手搭在他的爪上，但沒那麼做。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3624
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_af6b5cd3:

    # nulln "I thought giving him space was what he needed."
    nulln "我以為，他需要一點空間。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3625
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_6638f76c:

    # nulln "I thought letting him come back to me when he was ready was what he wanted."
    nulln "我以為，他想要等打理好心境後再回到我身邊。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3626
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_5a81efb4:

    # nulln "He needed me..."
    nulln "他需要我……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3633
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_6db25f4f:

    # centered "{size=70}{color=#FFFFFF}{cps=5}and I abandoned him."
    centered "{size=70}{color=#FFFFFF}{cps=5}我卻拋棄了他。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3637
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_76b2fe88_6:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3663
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_348e47e3:

    # nulln sideSean Quiet "It had been three years, but unsurprisingly Baxter's was as lively as I remember."
    nulln sideSean Quiet "三年過去了，但不出所料，Baxter還是和記憶中一樣熱鬧。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3674
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_d17e251b:

    # nulln "It looked like they had recently finished building a new seating area. Though we were seated in one of the old booths."
    nulln "他們好像最近剛增建了新座位區。不過我們被安排在一個舊卡座上。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3680
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_e7739055:

    # nulln "Thankfully the old homely style we knew them for was still around."
    nulln "幸好我們熟悉的那種溫馨舊風格沒變。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3681
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_aafa0a09:

    # nulln "Rocco orders a rum and coke while Cody gets a sprite. I just get water."
    nulln "Rocco點了朗姆和可樂，Cody點了雪碧，我只點了水。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3685
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_d1d41267:

    # nulln "While our waiter gets the drinks I start looking through the menu."
    nulln "服務生去拿飲料時，我開始看菜單。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3686
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_737ed7e7:

    # nulln "Their burnt ends were always good."
    nulln "他們的焦邊肉很不錯。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3687
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_35732d13:

    # nulln "I think I used to get the pork chops since there really wasn't anywhere else to get them."
    nulln "我以前好像常點豬排，畢竟沒什麼其他地方有賣。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3691
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_f4a21d79:

    # nulln Scared "Rocco liked the grilled chicken sand{cps=5}...{/}wich{cps=5}...{/}"
    nulln Scared "Rocco喜歡烤雞三明{cps=5}……{/}治{cps=5}……{/}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3699
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_a1d22759:

    # narrator Crying2 "I see it."
    narrator Crying2 "我看到了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3701
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_552b0384:

    # "There in the middle of all the other sandwiches."
    "就在其他三明治當中。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3703
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_ba53c43e:

    # "Pulled pork, sweet barbecue sauce, onion straws, extra fries, and a fountain soda."
    "手撕豬肉、甜烤肉醬、洋蔥絲、加點薯條，以及一杯汽水。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3704
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_4c046482:

    # "The Casey."
    "Casey套餐。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3706
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_e64eecc1:

    # rocco Sad "Sean?"
    rocco Sad "Sean？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3708
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_269ff1fd:

    # sean Concerned "Huh?"
    sean Concerned "啊？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3710
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_abd37974:

    # "I look up at their concerned faces."
    "我抬頭，看見他們擔憂的神情。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3711
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_83646743:

    # narrator Sad "It's only then that I realize I'm crying."
    narrator Sad "才驚覺自己在哭。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3712
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_f0c9ca82:

    # "I place the menu down on the table, and try to stammer out a few words."
    "我把菜單放在桌上，試圖說出幾個字。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3715
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_2436d9be:

    # narrator Crying2 "My brain has stopped working so I just point to the sandwich."
    narrator Crying2 "我的腦袋當機了，只能指著那份三明治。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3726
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_e7c0fe2a:

    # nvl clear
    # nulln sideSean Quiet "It was a long ride home."
    nvl clear
    nulln sideSean Quiet "回家的路很漫長。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3728
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_da0e031f:

    # nulln "I didn't say anything."
    nulln "我一語不發。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3739
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_25bec0fd:

    # nulln sideSean Quiet "Cody dropped me off at my place, and left with Rocco."
    nulln sideSean Quiet "Cody把我送到家後，就跟Rocco離開了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3745
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_d7f99b15:

    # nulln sideSean Quiet "I put the leftover fries in the fridge, and tried my best not to wake mom and dad stumbling back to my room."
    nulln sideSean Quiet "我把剩下的薯條放進冰箱，步履蹣跚地回到房間，盡量避免吵醒爸媽。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3746
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_ab532a72:

    # nulln "It wasn't late, maybe nine or ten when I got back, but they had work the next day."
    nulln "我回來得不算晚，大概九或十點，但他們名天要上班。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3754
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_e9cc7a7f:

    # nulln sideSean Neutral "I laid in bed for the next two hours, tossing and turning."
    nulln sideSean Neutral "接下來得兩小時，我在床上輾轉反側。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3755
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_120d777e:

    # nulln "Trying to find the right position to sleep in."
    nulln "試著找到適合入睡的姿勢。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3756
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_c808d4d6:

    # nulln "Hoping that if I found the spot and laid still enough my body would shut down."
    nulln "但願只要安靜躺著，身體就會關機。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3757
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_8c24aef3:

    # nulln Quiet "I wanted to get to tomorrow as fast as possible. It didn't work."
    nulln Quiet "我想儘早迎來明天。然而沒用。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3758
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_277a5017:

    # nulln "I still couldn't get my mind off of everything."
    nulln "我還是沒能把思緒移開這一切。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3760
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_76b2fe88_7:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3762
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_1615b54c:

    # nulln Concerned "My walk, alone in the woods. Ranting to myself about Cody's situation."
    nulln Concerned "我獨自在樹林裡散步、抱怨Cody的情況。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3763
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_d0bd0b3f:

    # nulln "I still don't know why I thought he had a scalpel in his bathroom."
    nulln "我還是不知道自己怎麼會覺得他浴室裡有手術刀。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3765
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_1c43439f:

    # nulln Scrutinizing "Why do I feel like I need to talk to someone about my conversation with Rocco in the Car?"
    nulln Scrutinizing "我為什麼會想跟某人聊聊我和Rocco在車裡的談話？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3767
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_56995599:

    # nulln Concerned "My walk with Rocco, talking about Cody's situation."
    nulln Concerned "我和Rocco一起散步，談論Cody的情況。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3768
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_5821a2b3:

    # nulln "How weird it felt seeing the raccoon in such a state."
    nulln "那隻浣熊的狀態，實在太不對勁了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3769
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_dc8e9538:

    # nulln "Why didn't I feel guilty for leaving him alone at the campsite..."
    nulln "把他一個人留在營地，我怎麼就一點都不內疚……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3771
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_087b4207:

    # nulln Concerned "My walk with Cody. How it seemed like the chaos of everything helped bring him back to earth."
    nulln Concerned "我和Cody一起散步。總覺得這一切混沌反而讓他正常了些。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3773
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_7720b344:

    # nulln Quiet "How I kept talking to myself about Cody. Hearing Sarah's voice, and how she couldn't remember her husband."
    nulln Quiet "我一直自言自語談論Cody、聽到Sarah的聲音，還有她不記得丈夫的事。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3775
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_e04e7692:

    # nulln Quiet "All the missing people of the hotel."
    nulln Quiet "失蹤的所有旅館客人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3777
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_dde92228:

    # nulln Neutral "That conversation with Cody by the river, the mall, the dinner..."
    nulln Neutral "和Cody在河邊的對話、商場、晚餐……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3778
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_19dc8793:

    # nulln "Everything just felt wrong, and my mind couldn't stop thinking about it."
    nulln "一切都很不對勁，我的思緒停不下來。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3779
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_a71833e7:

    # nulln Quiet "Usually I could just wallow my way out of situations like this."
    nulln Quiet "通常我都能沉浸其中，反過來脫離這種狀況："

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3780
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_775a0a3b:

    # nulln "Spend so much time stewing on what ifs that I tire myself out."
    nulln "長時間不斷設想，最後就會想累自己。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3781
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_e090a0c3:

    # nulln Neutral "Not this time sadly."
    nulln Neutral "只可惜這次不行。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3787
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_76b2fe88_8:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3789
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_057d598d:

    # nulln sideSean Neutral "I decided to throw on my coat and go for a walk."
    nulln sideSean Neutral "我決定披上外套出去走走。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3790
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_cbc9eb8f:

    # nulln "I wasn't gonna sleep anyway."
    nulln "反正也睡不著。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3791
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_93f15e51:

    # nulln "Soft snow crunches under my pads."
    nulln "柔軟的雪被我腳掌踩響。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3792
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_14e2e54b:

    # nulln "The gentle glow of the moon fills the sky as it and the stars dance along the horizon."
    nulln "柔和的月光填滿天空，與星星在地平線上共舞。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3793
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_a66c55aa:

    # nulln "The white hue of the street lamps guide me along Carthage's crumbling asphalt."
    nulln "街燈的白光引導我走在迦太基破碎的柏油路上。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3794
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_b78ec752:

    # nulln "Each lamp their own star, far more reachable than the ones Casey and I would dream of."
    nulln "每盞燈都像一顆星星，遠比我和Casey曾經的夢想更觸手可及。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3796
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_803136a6:

    # nvl clear
    # nulln sideSean Sad "I missed these nights."
    nvl clear
    nulln sideSean Sad "我很懷念那些夜晚。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3798
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_9dcda5b3:

    # nulln "The lonely hour where we would meet."
    nulln "我們幽會的寂寥時刻。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3799
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_bb730503:

    # nulln "The world so quiet we could finally hear each other."
    nulln "世界靜謐，我們終於得以聽見彼此。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3800
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_25271b04:

    # nulln sideSean Happy "We'd dance through our town's cosmos without a care in the world."
    nulln sideSean Happy "我們會在小鎮的宇宙中起舞，毫不在意俗世。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3801
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_4112d59c:

    # nulln "Holding each other's paws knowing only the stars could see us."
    nulln "牽起彼此的爪，知曉只有星辰看得到我們。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3802
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_e5d08273:

    # nulln "Dreaming of the day we could finally do this under the warmth of the sun."
    nulln "夢想著有朝一日，亦能在陽光的溫暖下做這些事。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3803
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_9f7b5457:

    # nulln sideSean Trauma "He used to joke about us being half vampire. The bad half. The half that can't exist in the light."
    nulln sideSean Trauma "他曾開玩笑說我們有一半是吸血鬼。壞的那一半；見不得光的那一半。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3804
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_c16e20c2:

    # nulln "The half that has to be invited to a community, never assumed to be a part of it."
    nulln "必須受邀才能進入社群，終歸是個異類。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3805
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_21d1b750:

    # nulln sideSean Happy "Thankfully we could still eat garlic, and cross running water."
    nulln sideSean Happy "幸好我們還能吃大蒜，也能橫跨流水。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3806
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_e7464fd3:

    # nulln "We got to keep those parts."
    nulln "我們還保有那些部分。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3812
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_76b2fe88_9:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3814
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_c0210bcc:

    # nulln sideSean Neutral "I was surprised to find myself back in front of the hole."
    nulln sideSean Neutral "我訝異地發現，自己又回到了那個坑前。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3815
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_34c2a6f7:

    # nulln "Even in the dead of night it looked supernaturally dark."
    nulln "即使在深夜，它看起來也暗得超乎自然。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3816
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_41a4f1cb:

    # nulln "A gaping abyss sitting in the middle of nothing."
    nulln "在一片虛無之中張開大口的深淵。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3820
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_397348c1:

    # narrator sideSean Quiet "There wasn't any sound, and unlike any of the recordings I saw, there was nothing in it."
    narrator sideSean Quiet "沒有任何動靜，也不像我看過的那些錄影，裡面什麼都沒有。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3821
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_a7ffd884:

    # "I couldn't see the bottom, but I also didn't feel like pulling out my phone to check if it was still there."
    "深不見底，但我也不想拿出手機確認它是否還在。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3825
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_76fc0171:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "Instead I turned my head up hearing the grumblings of an all too familiar husky."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "反之，我抬起頭，聽見一隻再熟悉不過的哈士奇在抱怨。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3828
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_2fface20:

    # rocco "Oh shit... What're you doing here?"
    rocco "喔靠……你在這裡幹嘛？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3832
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_8d7f6771:

    # sean "Same thing as you."
    sean "跟你一樣。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3836
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_ca669db1:

    # "The dog lets out a groan."
    "狗發出一道呻吟。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3840
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_2ba008ce:

    # rocco "Man, I really shouldn't be out this late."
    rocco "天啊，我真不該這麼晚還跑來外頭的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3844
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_f9a2efba:

    # sean sideSean Concerned "Work right?"
    sean sideSean Concerned "明天要工作？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3847
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_7a0e634b:

    # rocco "Bright and early. Nobody showed up today."
    rocco "一大清早就要。今天沒人來。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3850
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_335da11b:

    # rocco "Hey, have you been getting strange calls?"
    rocco "欸，你最近有接到奇怪的電話嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3853
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_3ab22981:

    # sean "No. Why?"
    sean "沒有。怎麼了？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3857
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_c33061cc:

    # rocco "I had to turn my phone off."
    rocco "我不得不把手機關了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3858
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_dcfa1f72:

    # rocco "I kept getting bombarded by a number I didn't recognize. Didn't know the voice either."
    rocco "我一直被一個不認識的號碼狂轟，聲音也不耳熟。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3861
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_2c2b3a1f:

    # sean sideSean Scrutinizing "You don't think..."
    sean sideSean Scrutinizing "你是不是覺得……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3870
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_613f514a:

    # cody Scared "It has something to do with the hole?"
    cody Scared "跟這個坑有關？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3873
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_8bc2e7c4:

    # "We both jump, and turn to look at the raccoon."
    "我們兩個都嚇了一跳，轉頭看向浣熊。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3878
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_22897563:

    # cody Concerned "I mean why else do you think we keep finding ourselves here?"
    cody Concerned "不然我們怎麼會一直過來這裡？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3881
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_16001850:

    # rocco "Cody... are you ok?"
    rocco "Cody……你還好嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3887
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_4ef06efa:

    # cody "No. But I don't think that's important."
    cody "不好。但這不重要。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3890
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_b0445f33:

    # "Where is this bluntness coming from?"
    "他說話怎麼這麼衝？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3894
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_aa100b9d:

    # rocco "Do you want to talk about-"
    rocco "你想談談——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3897
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_f87e6dd3:

    # cody Neutral "I'd rather not. In fact, I think we should just get to the point."
    cody Neutral "我不想。不如直接切入正題吧。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3900
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_56a47b3b:

    # "He walks over to the street lamp, then starts tugging on the rope descending into the hole."
    "他走向街燈，拉動那條垂進坑裡的繩子。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3904
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_10a683af:

    # cody "Well?"
    cody "怎麼樣？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3907
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_20e61c43:

    # "Rocco gives him a look. I think I know what Cody's getting at."
    "Rocco望著他。我明白Cody的意思。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3908
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_177ecd56:

    # "No one's around, and everything we've seen points to the hole."
    "周圍沒人，而我們的所見所聞都指向那個坑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3909
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_dd9816b7:

    # narrator Embarrassed "I'd be lying if I said I wasn't curious about it."
    narrator Embarrassed "如果說不好奇，那肯定是騙人的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3913
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_45ee7661:

    # rocco Quiet "No we're not-"
    rocco Quiet "不行，我們不——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3919
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_833599de:

    # cody "You don't have to, but I know if I go down there, you're going to follow after me."
    cody "你不必跟著，但我知道，要是我下去了，你也會跟來的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3922
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_a2ab8e97:

    # cody "So let's skip the back and forth ok."
    cody "就省省討價還價吧。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3925
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_bf86e001:

    # "Rocco sighs."
    "Rocco嘆了口氣。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3938
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_a5c1eddc:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "Cody isn't waiting for us at the bottom. He's already begun looking and investigating the devices and cables that litter the floor of the hole."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "Cody沒在底下等我們。早就在調查散落在坑底的設備和纜線了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3944
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_65237a29:

    # "Looking around I see various computers covered in snow, cables running around the unstable ground, and a ladder tall enough to be propped up to get out."
    "我環顧四周，可見被雪覆蓋的各種電腦、蜿蜒在不穩定的地面上的電纜，還有一架高到足以爬出去的梯子。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3947
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_9c350b5d:

    # narrator Embarrassed "It's strange, the hole feels a lot shorter than those videos."
    narrator Embarrassed "奇怪，這天坑感覺比那些影片裡淺很多。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3951
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_56120fdf:

    # "I can easily see out of it, but it was so dark looking in."
    "輕易就能看見外面的樣子，但從上面看進來卻烏漆墨黑的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3958
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_319307cc:

    # narrator Concerned "Then our attention is all drawn to the same thing, at the same time."
    narrator Concerned "接著，我們的注意力一同被一樣東西吸引過去。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3959
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_f7685d1c:

    # "A massive cave leading further under the town."
    "一個通向小鎮深處的巨大洞穴。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3960
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_1588f8e7:

    # "It's impossible to see into it, and shining the light from my phone doesn't help."
    "裡面一片漆黑，連手機燈光也沒用。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3961
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_b21f043d:

    # "Wooden beams had been put up to keep the entrance stable, but our light only goes so far before it just becomes a black void."
    "有架著木樑以維持入口穩定，但燈光也只能照到那了，再之後就是漆黑的虛空。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3965
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_0654884f:

    # "Without saying a word Cody starts walking to the cave. Rocco's able to grab his shoulder before he can enter it."
    "Cody一言不發走向洞穴。Rocco在他進去前抓住他的肩膀。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3970
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_f0f406c6:

    # rocco Scared "The fuck you think you're going?"
    rocco Scared "你他媽想去哪？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3975
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_071e9363:

    # cody Concerned "Where else?"
    cody Concerned "還能是哪？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3980
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_99daf9f9:

    # rocco "There is no way in hell that you're going in there."
    rocco "你絕對不可以進去那裡。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3984
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_1bfcec56:

    # cody "It's the only spot to get answers."
    cody "那是唯一能找到答案的地方。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3988
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_eb132fbc:

    # sean Embarrassed "Cody you're starting to scare me... Rocco's right, we should just leave."
    sean Embarrassed "Cody，你這樣有點嚇人……Rocco說得沒錯，我們該走了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3989
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_4a56cc77:

    # sean "There're people already looking into this. We don't need to go in there."
    sean "已經有人在調查這事了。我們用不著進去。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3994
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_f73a0db2:

    # cody "Where are they Sean? None of the equipment down here has been touched in days."
    cody "那他們人在哪，Sean？這些設備都好幾天沒人動過了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:3998
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_45a974d5:

    # rocco "How would you-"
    rocco "你怎麼——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4005
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_a57255df:

    # cody Neutral "The snow. There's no foot prints, a light blanket over all the tech, and the only place they could be is in there."
    cody Neutral "雪——沒有腳印，所有設備上都有一層薄雪。他們只可能是在那裡面了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4009
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_2997b93c:

    # rocco "Then we should be smart and have someone else investigate it."
    rocco "那咱們就該明智點，讓別人去調查得了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4014
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_26d33f12:

    # cody Concerned "They'll check into the hotel,"
    cody Concerned "他們會先去旅館，"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4017
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_6c4e9886:

    # "He makes a big gesture to the cave."
    "他大舉示意洞穴。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4021
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_fec8cdd0:

    # cody "go in there, and then we'll forget they ever came."
    cody "接著進去裡面，然後我們就會把他們來過的事都給忘了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4024
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_67fe113c:

    # narrator Neutral "He has a point."
    narrator Neutral "他說得有道理。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4025
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_c3249ab5:

    # narrator Concerned "All those missing people in the hotel, and the one I forgot..."
    narrator Concerned "那些失蹤的的旅館客人，還有我忘了的那個人……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4026
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_886fb8b2:

    # "Something is going on and it's pointing to whatever happens in that hole."
    "我們的所見所聞，全都指向那個坑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4033
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_171f6569:

    # cody "I'm not going to force you to go in there, but I've made up my mind."
    cody "我不會強迫你們進去，但我已經下定決心了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4035
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_581db034:

    # cody "I'm tired of wandering around in the dark."
    cody "我不想再在黑暗中徬徨了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4039
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_4de6afc5:

    # narrator Happy "There's a light behind his eyes."
    narrator Happy "他眼裡有光。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4040
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_e7898fbe:

    # "Something that had been missing all these days."
    "久違地。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4041
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_3ab1353a:

    # "It was the reason he studied medicine, why he would help Casey and I with our homework."
    "那就是他學醫的原因、輔導我和Casey和我做作業的原因。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4042
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_fa00b7fd:

    # "Cody helps people, it's what brings him joy. I guess he thinks he can do something here."
    "Cody樂於助人。想必他是覺得，自己在這裡能做點什麼。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4046
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_47ae48fc:

    # narrator Neutral "Rocco lets out a deep sigh, and puts another paw on the Raccoon's shoulder."
    narrator Neutral "Rocco深深嘆了口氣，把另一隻爪搭在浣熊的肩膀上。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4051
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_b95a35d1:

    # rocco "We go in, try to find someone, and see what's going on."
    rocco "那我們就進去，找找人、看看情況。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4053
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_eafc7c56:

    # rocco "You get one hour and if we don't find anyone I'm dragging you out."
    rocco "只待一小時，沒見到人的話，我拖也要把你拖出來。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4056
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_81d79176:

    # "Cody nods his head, and we step into the dark abyss."
    "Cody點點頭，我們踏進黑暗的深淵。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4073
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_a1391829:

    # narrator sideSean Neutral "The ground is a mixture of small rocks, mud, and clay. There are a few beams erected to hold up the tunnel, but they become fewer and fewer the deeper we go in."
    narrator sideSean Neutral "地地面是小石頭、泥土和黏土的混合物。有幾根梁柱支撐著隧道，但越往深處就越少。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4074
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_4a1502bd:

    # "For some reason as we get deeper the world gets darker."
    "不知為何，我們越是深入，世界就越黑暗。。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4084
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_f053cd7e:

    # narrator sideSeanHole Neutral "The walls that we once saw on the edge of our phone's flashlight become black voids. Our footsteps go from echoes on stone to pure silence."
    narrator sideSeanHole Neutral "原本在手機燈光盡頭可見的牆壁，變成了漆黑的虛空。原先在石路上迴響的腳步聲也轉為徹底的寂靜。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4085
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_cb6cedcf:

    # "I spin around to get a sense of the world around me and come up blank."
    "我轉一圈身子，想感受這個世界，卻只有一片空白。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4086
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_94fa9354:

    # narrator Scrutinizing "It didn't feel like the walls were diverging away from us, but no matter where I shine my light nothing appears."
    narrator Scrutinizing "牆壁感覺並沒有偏離我們，但無論我把光朝向哪裡，都什麼也照不出來。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4091
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_e8cc9adc:

    # sean Embarrassed "Uuuh guys? Do you see the wall?"
    sean Embarrassed "呃呃，大夥們？你們看得到牆壁嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4098
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_758d6075:

    # narrator Concerned "Upon saying that Cody immediately bonks into nothing."
    narrator Concerned "話音剛落，Cody立刻撞上了虛無。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4103
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_935a0627:

    # "It catches us by surprise as Rocco unintentionally walks into Cody. He apologies to the poor raccoon, but it doesn't seem like Cody minds."
    "我們大吃一驚，Rocco不小心撞到Cody。他向可憐的浣熊道歉，但Cody似乎不在意。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4106
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_82abe001:

    # narrator Neutral "Instead he reaches forward to the wall of nothing he walked into and his hand can fully extend."
    narrator Neutral "相反地，他把手伸向撞到的虛無之牆，並完全伸直。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4110
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_98acafbd:

    # sean Scrutinizing "That's..."
    sean Scrutinizing "這……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4113
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_2191aa18:

    # cody Concerned "Physically impossible."
    cody Concerned "物理上不可能啊。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4116
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_bca82687:

    # sean Neutral "I was going to say strange, but yeah... Impossibly possible."
    sean Neutral "我本來想說的是「好怪喔」，但沒錯……不可能卻真的發生了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4121
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_7ad39b66:

    # rocco "Ok, that is turn around worthy."
    rocco "好，我們這就該轉身離開了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4125
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_bf8645c4:

    # narrator Concerned "Rocco grabs Cody's paw and I see his tail floof up."
    narrator Concerned "Rocco抓住Cody的爪，讓他的尾巴都炸毛了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4127
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_ea1b92e5:

    # "He tries to stammer out a protest, but can't."
    "他結結巴巴地試圖抗議，卻什麼都說不出來。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4129
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_1a215019:

    # "I can't entirely blame him."
    "這也怪不得他。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4132
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_544528ed:

    # "Especially after telling me that he was in love with Rocco."
    "畢竟他都告訴我他愛上Rocco了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4134
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_5fc5e6da:

    # "Cody looks at me for help, but I'm with Rocco on this one."
    "Cody看過來求助，但這次我站Rocco這邊。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4135
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_5f4c3067:

    # narrator Neutral "We haven't been down here for that long. We have to be close to the entrance."
    narrator Neutral "我們下來還沒多久。一定很靠近入口。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4136
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_941f4552:

    # "So we just keep walking."
    "於是繼續走。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4137
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_f8591392:

    # "And walking."
    "走著。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4138
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_cc5fca64:

    # narrator Quiet2 "And walking..."
    narrator Quiet2 "走著……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4139
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_a8e5bd0d:

    # "And... walking..."
    "走著……走著……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4152
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_b0724b85:

    # narrator sideSeanHole Neutral "It feels like we should be going back to the moon lit front, but the light never comes."
    narrator sideSeanHole Neutral "感覺也是時候回到月光下的入口了，一直沒見到光線。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4153
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_941f4552_1:

    # "So we just keep walking."
    "所以我們就繼續走。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4154
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_ccd48e88:

    # "and walking..."
    "一直走……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4157
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_ae64e59f:

    # sean Angry "I still can't see the walls."
    sean Angry "我還是看不到牆。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4161
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_95b16ab2:

    # cody Neutral "Maybe you should turn off your light. Better to conserve battery. It's not like there's anything to see."
    cody Neutral "還是把燈關掉吧。最好省點電。反正也什麼都看不見。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4164
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_1c5f1da2:

    # "I'm still at 80 percent, but he's right."
    "我電量還有80%，但他說得對。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4169
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_0f05b84a:

    # rocco "Uuugh! I knew this was a bad idea!"
    rocco "呃呃啊！我就知道這主意糟透了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4173
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_1f163128:

    # cody "Relax we're going to be-"
    cody "放心，我們會——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4177
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_097e0b1c:

    # rocco Scared "No! Why'd you have to go poking your snout where it don't belong!"
    rocco Scared "不對！你為什麼非要多事啊！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4178
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_137da676:

    # rocco Quiet "For all we know we could be fucking trapped here for the rest of our god damn lives!"
    rocco Quiet "搞不好下半輩子都他媽要被關在這了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4182
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_ee680bea:

    # "I see Cody shrink into himself. Rocco is still pissed."
    "Cody縮起身子。Rocco持續發火。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4185
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_55396c4d:

    # rocco "There were people looking into this, but no we had to play fucking investigator!"
    rocco "都已經有人在調查了，我們就非他媽要扮偵探不可！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4186
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_5ff5edb5:

    # rocco "Get mixed up in the shit in the hotel."
    rocco "捲進旅館的破事。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4187
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_8be7d0fb:

    # rocco "Get fucking trapped in this fuck ass cave."
    rocco "被他媽困在這坑裡。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4188
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_f6f16190:

    # rocco "All because you couldn't lay off this stupid fucking hole!"
    rocco "都是因為你放不下這個蠢天坑！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4193
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_67553928:

    # narrator Concerned "I see tears start to build in Cody's eyes. I want to step in, but I'm just as scared as him."
    narrator Concerned "Cody眼眶溢出淚水。我想介入，但跟他一樣害怕。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4195
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_2ad0401e:

    # narrator Quiet "I look back at my phone."
    narrator Quiet "我看回手機。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4198
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_4bb2aad8:

    # sean Embarrassed "Umm... R-Rocco... I- uh well I..."
    sean Embarrassed "呃……R、Rocco……我……呃，我……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4202
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_f9b50089:

    # rocco Scared "What the fuck is it Sean!"
    rocco Scared "怎樣啦，Sean！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4205
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_23b420f0:

    # "I pause trembling as I see the blood thirsty eyes of the husky."
    "看到哈士奇那雙殺紅的眼，我顫抖地僵了一下。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4208
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_f43e5ee8:

    # sean Embarrassed "M-my p-phone ha-has service."
    sean Embarrassed "我、我的手、手機有、有訊號。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4213
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_4d6f0929:

    # "I point to the 4g LTE symbol on my phone and that seems to distract him."
    "我指著手機上的4G LTE符號，這似乎消解了的情緒。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4216
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_0b36bbc9:

    # narrator Concerned "He and Cody look at their phones and sigh in relief."
    narrator Concerned "他和Cody看向自己的手機，鬆了口氣。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4219
translate Tchinese sean12202024ka_ff830132:

    # narrator Neutral "Who should I call for help?"
    narrator Neutral "我該打給誰求救？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4228
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_0dc07980:

    # narrator Quiet "The others seem to have the same luck as me."
    narrator Quiet "其他人似乎跟我一樣倒楣。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4229
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_6eee5620:

    # "Cody is mumbling to himself while Rocco curses someone out."
    "Cody在自言自語，Rocco則在破口大罵。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4232
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_eb3aa5c4:

    # "I let them finish their conversations just numb to what I experienced."
    "我讓他們講完電話，對自己經歷的一切已經麻木不仁。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4234
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_9312d8c7:

    # narrator Concerned "Rocco hangs up his call, and is about to spike his phone to the ground. He stops himself shoving it back into his pocket."
    narrator Concerned "Rocco掛斷電話，想把手機砸向地面。然後停住自己，並把手機塞回口袋。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4237
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_d2f90fd4:

    # "Cody doesn't seem to be calling anyone, instead he's scrolling through his contacts."
    "Cody似乎沒在打電話，而是在翻找聯絡人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4242
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_8782cd59:

    # sean Neutral "So I called 9-1-1. They said they can get someone out by noon tomorrow."
    sean Neutral "我打了911。說是明天中午能派人過來。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4246
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_5af7c391:

    # rocco "That's bullshit!"
    rocco "這也太扯了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4250
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_96a948a3:

    # sean "Tell me about it."
    sean "可不是嗎。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4251
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_53c16934:

    # sean "Apparently they've gotten so many calls their system says every unit within 100 miles of us is in here."
    sean "他們好像接到很多通報，系統顯示方圓一百英里內所有單位都在這裡了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4255
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_3fe20ef6:

    # rocco "There weren't that many cars outside."
    rocco "外面沒那麼多車啊。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4259
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_0c290b33:

    # cody "There aren't many people this side of Appalachia. I bet they parked elsewhere because of the crowded streets too."
    cody "阿帕拉契山這邊人員不多。街道這麼擁擠，他們車肯定停在別的地方了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4263
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_4fac6bf9:

    # sean Embarrassed "Wait did neither of you call 9-1-1?"
    sean Embarrassed "等等，你們兩個都沒打911？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4266
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_4cad0a58:

    # "They both blink at me."
    "他們兩個對我傻眼。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4271
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_094732a1:

    # cody Scared "Well I don't know how much help they'll be. If they ask around town no one is going to know who we are."
    cody Scared "感覺幫不上什麼忙啊。要是他們在鎮上問人，也沒人會知道我們是誰。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4274
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_ce724408:

    # sean "I'm sorry?"
    sean "什麼意思？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4279
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_140dda17:

    # rocco "We've been forgotten dipshit. Nobody know who the fuck we are so no one is coming."
    rocco "我們被忘掉了啦，白痴。沒人他媽知道我們是誰，不會有人來的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4283
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_86d63cef:

    # cody Embarrassed "You didn't call anyone in town?"
    cody Embarrassed "你沒打給鎮上的人嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4284
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_5d5c2c2f:

    # cody "Remember when we went to the police station and they said no one was showing up?"
    cody "還記得我們去警局時，他們說沒人來值勤嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4287
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_c8436e1c:

    # sean Neutral "Well 9-1-1 is also ambulances and the fire department."
    sean Neutral "嗯，911也包括救護車和消防局。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4292
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_54e68012:

    # cody Embarrassed "And they're probably all down here."
    cody Embarrassed "而且他們大概全都在這裡。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4293
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_1442f6d5:

    # cody "I was trying to find a contact of someone I didn't recognize. Maybe we might be able to meet up with someone down here."
    cody "我剛才在找我不認識的聯絡人。想說也許能跟某些人在這裡會合。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4294
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_8f0f712f:

    # cody "Then I realized there aren't really any landmarks to help guide them to us."
    cody "才想到根本沒有地標能找到彼此。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4299
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_ab8d74dd:

    # rocco Neutral "So now what?"
    rocco Neutral "那現在怎麼辦？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4302
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_0b045886:

    # cody "We{nw}"
    cody "我們{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4305
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_a6a92d07:

    # cody "We{fast} wai-"
    cody "我們{fast}等——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4309
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_6ee2b8d1:

    # "The raccoon cuts himself off as his eyes go wide."
    "浣熊突然僵住，雙眼瞪大。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4310
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_a7b255f8:

    # "Rocco's quickly follow."
    "Rocco也一樣。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4311
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_940ab5d4:

    # "I slowly turn to face whatever it is they're looking at."
    "我慢慢轉身面對他們看見的東西。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4315
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_0b79f261:

    # narrator Concerned "I wonder if he's looking for names he doesn't recognize."
    narrator Concerned "不知道他是不是在找不認識的名字。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4318
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_10de0566:

    # sean Embarrassed "G-gonna take a w-wild guess here. Neither of you talked t-to someone w-who knew who we w-were?"
    sean Embarrassed "我、我大膽猜一下。你們都沒跟認、認識我們的人講、講過話吧？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4323
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_70896573:

    # "They both nod their heads."
    "他們都點頭。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4324
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_0767246d:

    # narrator Neutral "Great... That's just what we needed."
    narrator Neutral "好了好了……這下好了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4327
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_2eff651c:

    # sean Concerned "I-I mean there's no way everyone forgot us... Right."
    sean Concerned "不、不可能所有人都忘了我們……對吧？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4332
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_031345a1:

    # cody "I guess that's what happens here. I thought about calling a name I didn't recognize in my contacts."
    cody "這大概就是這地方發生的事了。我有考慮過打給聯絡人裡某個不認識的名字。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4335
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_035347e0:

    # "Cody opens his arms wide gesturing to the vast nothingness around us."
    "Cody張開雙臂，示意周圍浩瀚的虛無。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4336
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_2282f146:

    # "How is he so calm during all of this."
    "這種情況下，他怎麼能如此冷靜？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4341
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_96e2f367:

    # cody "But then how could I guide them to us? There's no landmarks for us to find each other."
    cody "但又要怎麼指路呢？沒有地標能找到彼此。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4346
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_e1f2ef13:

    # rocco Quiet "How the fuck can you stay so calm during all of this?"
    rocco Quiet "都這種情況了，你他媽還能這麼冷靜？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4350
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_8fc68ff7:

    # cody "I've been coasting on adrenaline ever since I slid down that rope."
    cody "我從滑下繩子開始，就一直是靠腎上腺素撐著的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4351
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_5d882fdc:

    # cody "It'll probably wear off in an hour and I'll be an absolute mess."
    cody "大概一小時後就會消退，然後我就會徹底崩潰。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4354
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_420f2e2a:

    # "We all take a breath to try and compose ourselves."
    "我們都深吸一口氣，試著鎮靜自己。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4360
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_24c0675c:

    # sean Neutral "Well I called 9-1-1."
    sean Neutral "嗯，我打了911。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4363
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_b60f59d5:

    # rocco "And?"
    rocco "然後呢？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4368
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_51e71689:

    # sean Embarrassed "They said someone will be out at the entrance tomorrow at noon."
    sean Embarrassed "他們說明天中午會有人到入口。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4371
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_f068f6aa:

    # "Rocco groans at that."
    "Rocco聽罷，一陣呻吟。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4376
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_19f958c3:

    # sean Neutral "However, they said that we should stay in one spot."
    sean Neutral "不過，他們說我們應該待在原地。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4377
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_a73f6ed4:

    # sean "Every dispatch unit within 100 miles of Carthage is currently in the hole. Someone will probably find us."
    sean "迦太基方圓一百英里內的所有派遣單位，目前都在坑裡。大概會有人來找我們的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4381
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_529c1848:

    # rocco Quiet "I don't like probably."
    rocco Quiet "你這「大概」有點懸啊。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4385
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_850c69fc:

    # sean "Better than nothing."
    sean "總比沒有強。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4391
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_638afb4d:

    # narrator Concerned "Out of nowhere I see their eyes widen; lock onto something behind me."
    narrator Concerned "他倆眼睛莫名睜大；鎖定我身後的東西。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4392
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_352e83b5:

    # "I spin around to see what's caught their attention."
    "我轉過身看他們在注目什麼。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4397
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_d1cb939e:

    # rocco Concerned "Well we should probably get going. Look for some kind of way out."
    rocco Concerned "我們也該走了。去找找出口。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4400
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_d7c6eddd:

    # "Cody nods."
    "Cody點頭。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4401
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_d2d11f7a:

    # narrator Angry "For once I don't agree with the raccoon. When you're lost in the woods its usually a good idea to stay in one place."
    narrator Angry "這次我不同意浣熊。在樹林裡迷路，通常最好待在原地別亂跑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4404
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_630bd0d7:

    # sean Neutral "Isn't it better to wait in one spot for help to come get us?"
    sean Neutral "待在原地等救援來不是比較好嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4408
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_7e8cf45f:

    # rocco "Sean, what help is coming? No one knows who we are..."
    rocco "Sean，會有什麼救援？沒人認識我們……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4413
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_d3a89d11:

    # cody "Well we can assume that other people are down here. In the event of an emergency it's best{nw}"
    cody "呃，這底下估計還有其他人。在緊急情況下最好{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4416
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_604feee9:

    # cody Concerned "Well we can assume that other people are down here. In the event of an emergency it's best{fast} too-"
    cody Concerned "呃，這底下估計還有其他人在。在緊急情況下最好{fast}也——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4420
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_bf93858d:

    # "Cody cuts himself off."
    "Cody突然僵住。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4421
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_299822ba:

    # "Both Rocco and his eyes go wide as they stare at something behind me."
    "Rocco和他都瞪大雙眼，盯著我身後的東西。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4425
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_76b2fe88:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4430
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_7f226015:

    # nulln "Standing off in the darkness is a muscular lion man."
    nulln "黑暗中站著一個肌肉發達的獅男。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4431
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_8bf8678f:

    # nulln "It's hard to tell from this distance, but he seems to be shorter than Rocco."
    nulln "從這距離難以判斷，但他似乎比Rocco矮。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4432
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_ea91311d:

    # nulln "On his face, a bone white mask with three horns sits upon a blood soaked mane."
    nulln "在他臉上，一副有三根角的骨白色面具坐落於染血的鬃毛上。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4433
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_aa0a16bb:

    # nulln "No eyes rest beneath the sockets of the mask."
    nulln "面具的眼框下，沒有眼睛。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4434
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_8b9dbd6b:

    # nulln "The man doesn't breathe, he doesn't speak."
    nulln "那人沒有呼吸，也不說話。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4435
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_4bc62b16:

    # nulln "We stare at each other for what seems to be an eternity."
    nulln "我們相互凝視，感覺時間都凝固了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4436
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_0f6b809c:

    # nulln "My heart pounds in my chest and I can feel myself hyperventilating."
    nulln "我心臟怦怦狂跳，身體在過度換氣。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4437
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_2a5ac084:

    # nulln "I feel a paw pull me back as Rocco takes a defensive stance in front of us."
    nulln "我感覺到一隻爪把我拉退，Rocco在我們前面擺出抵禦架勢。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4451
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_46c614c6:

    # narrator sideSeanHole Scared "The lion man takes a step forward."
    narrator sideSeanHole Scared "獅男向前踏了一步。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4459
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_4a38427d:

    # rocco "YOU STAY THE FUCK OVER THERE!"
    rocco "{b}你他媽給我別動！{/b}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4461
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_ee7e4852:

    # "He stops and holds up his hands."
    "他停住，舉起雙手。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4463
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_630234ea:

    # rocco "I don't know who the fuck you are, but you fucking stay away from us!"
    rocco "我不知道這傢伙是誰，但你他媽離我們遠點！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4466
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_0f112067:

    # "Cody looks like he wants to say something. He keeps opening his mouth, but immediately closes it."
    "Cody似乎想說什麼。嘴巴一直張開，卻又立刻閉上。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4468
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_ef7316ee:

    # "It looks like the lion is trembling."
    "獅子好像在發抖。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4472
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_76b2fe88_1:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4479
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_dbff4b07:

    # nulln "Then, with shaky paws, he reaches up to the sides of his mask."
    nulln "然後，他把顫抖的雙爪伸向面具兩側。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4480
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_76b2fe88_2:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4483
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_de9c6c66:

    # nulln "The silence of the darkness made it louder than it should be."
    nulln "黑暗的寂靜格外放大了聲響——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4484
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_7b6b63fd:

    # nvl clear
    # nulln "The visceral sounds of flesh being ripped from its body, the sounds of sinew snapping, and the laborious screams coming from the lion."
    nvl clear
    nulln "肉被從身體撕下的聲音、肌腱斷裂的聲音，以及獅子費力的絕叫。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4486
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_faf4c7af:

    # nvl clear
    # nulln "Gallons of blood pour out from his mane and mask."
    nvl clear
    nulln "大量血液從他的鬃毛和面具湧出。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4488
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_15146dea:

    # nvl clear
    # nulln "The blood, however, does not pool at his feet."
    nvl clear
    nulln "然而，血液並沒有積聚在他腳邊。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4490
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_94f24717:

    # nvl clear
    # nulln "Instead it falls endlessly down into an unseeable abyss."
    nvl clear
    nulln "而是滴落無盡的深淵。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4505
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_acf3977a:

    # nvl clear
    # nulln "The lion places the mask on his hip. The exposed skull mimicks deep and pained breaths."
    nvl clear
    nulln "獅子把面具放在腰間。暴露的頭骨模仿著深沉而痛苦的呼吸。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4509
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_028f7165:

    # nvl clear
    # centered "{color=#FFFFFF}He sits there on his paws and knees trying to catch his breath."
    nvl clear
    centered "{color=#FFFFFF}他跪坐在那裡，試圖喘氣。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4511
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_01771dca:

    # centered "{color=#FFFFFF}Then he pulls out another mask from behind, and slowly goes to place it on his skull."
    centered "{color=#FFFFFF}然後從身後拿出另一副面具，慢慢放到頭骨上。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4512
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_3a41eb51:

    # centered "{color=#FFFFFF}In the newfound silence of this transition Rocco whispers to Cody and I."
    centered "{color=#FFFFFF}在這段新的寂靜中，Rocco向Cody和我低語。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4514
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_929640ef:

    # centered "{size=100}{color=#FFFFFF}{cps=7}Run."
    centered "{size=100}{color=#FFFFFF}{cps=7}快跑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4523
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_4afce5e5:

    # narrator sideSeanHole Scared "Without a second thought the Raccoon and I bolt."
    narrator sideSeanHole Scared "我和浣熊不假思索地拔腿就跑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4527
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_d05a4f99:

    # "We hear another pained scream and the sounds of bones cracking."
    "我們聽見另一陣痛苦的尖叫和骨頭斷裂的聲音。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4529
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_4df4e8cb:

    # "Along with the heavy footfalls of Rocco behind us."
    "以及Rocco跑在我們身後的沉重腳步聲。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4530
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_e7a30391:

    # narrator Embarrassed "My eyes dart around in the darkness praying for any form of cover to appear."
    narrator Embarrassed "我的目光在黑暗中掃視，祈禱有掩體出現。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4534
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_d533a72a:

    # rocco Scared "Just keep fucking going!"
    rocco Scared "繼續跑就對了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4537
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_2b53aec9:

    # narrator Concerned "The screams turn to tears as I can hear the lion weeping."
    narrator Concerned "我聽到獅子的尖叫轉為哭號。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4538
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_9ae0ac89:

    # "I want to look back."
    "我想回頭。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4539
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_d386a9fc:

    # "To see its pain."
    "想看看它的痛苦。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4540
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_9423160a:

    # narrator Scared "But I can't."
    narrator Scared "但我不能。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4541
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_79af7313:

    # "I need to keep running."
    "我得繼續跑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4542
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_1e71b12b:

    # "My legs, however, have different plans for me. I feel them start to burn and slow."
    "然而，我的腿卻不同意。開始發疼、變得沉重。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4545
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_2fb25e95:

    # sean Crying "R-Rocco I don't-"
    sean Crying "R、Rocco，我沒法——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4548
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_0953cce5:

    # rocco "Just keep going Sean! I'm right behind you!"
    rocco "繼續跑就對了，Sean！我就在你後面！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4552
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_0d818bae:

    # cody Scared "To the right, a door!"
    cody Scared "右邊，有扇門！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4563
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_1841e7fd:

    # "My eyes follow the Raccoon and sure enough there it is."
    "我隨浣熊看去，還真的有。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4564
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_bfe16681:

    # "A door, framed against no wall, standing out in the middle of the darkness with nothing around it."
    "一扇門，沒有牆壁框住，兀自立於黑暗中央，周圍什麼都沒有。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4566
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_f8a1b657:

    # rocco "Move it!"
    rocco "閃開！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4568
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_c9392356:

    # "I do as the dog demands, and get out of the way."
    "我照狗說的給他讓路。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4576
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_912815f4:

    # "He rushes through, shoulder checking the door. Using his bulk to ram it open."
    "他衝向前，以體型為武器，用肩膀撞開了門。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4577
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_9efd9d04:

    # "He makes it look like running through paper as it smashes against a wall."
    "就像是衝破了紙張似的，門被砰地拍在牆上。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4580
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_ad2dad12:

    # "Cody makes it through before I do."
    "Cody比我先衝進去。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4581
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_775f319f:

    # "As I leap through the door; I spin around, and see what was behind me."
    "當我躍過門時，我轉過身，看見身後的狀況。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4588
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_0df6d634:

    # narrator Concerned "A masked, lion, woman paws on her knees out of breath."
    narrator Concerned "一個戴著面具的獅女跪在地上喘息。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4593
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_f3c2abd9:

    # narrator Sad "She reaches a single paw out to us before Rocco slams the door shut."
    narrator Sad "她向我們伸出一隻爪，Rocco則甩上了門。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4594
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_6145ab9e:

    # narrator Scared "No sign of the lion man."
    narrator Scared "獅男已不見蹤影。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4595
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_933daf89:

    # narrator Concerned "Part of me hopes she'll be alright."
    narrator Concerned "我暗自希望她能平安無事。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4611
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_443a519e:

    # cody sideSeanHole Scared "What... the fuck... was that?"
    cody sideSeanHole Scared "那……他媽……是什麼？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4614
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_b95a2177:

    # "We're all panting as Cody speaks."
    "Cody開口時，我們都在喘氣。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4618
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_68f4d26f:

    # rocco Happy "Heh... l-language man..."
    rocco Happy "呵……注、注意用語啊……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4621
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_45f78395:

    # "In between the breaths we laugh at that."
    "我們邊喘著氣邊笑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4624
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_9b4219fa:

    # narrator Neutral "I lay down on the soft carpet of the room. Looking up at a familiar ceiling light, and glow in the dark stars shaped like constellations."
    narrator Neutral "我躺在房間柔軟的地毯上。抬頭看著熟悉的天花板燈，以及像星座一樣的夜光星空。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4625
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_6e2e15d5:

    # "I turn my head to the side and see two familiar twin beds, dressers at their feet."
    "我把頭轉向一側，看到兩張熟悉的成對單人床，床腳邊各有梳妝台。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4626
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_7b97632a:

    # "The dresser on the far side of the room has a noticeable dent in it. One that I'm all too familiar with."
    "較遠處的梳妝台有明顯的凹痕。我再熟悉不過了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4630
translate Tchinese sean12202024kap2_534fa2c7:

    # sean Concerned "Rocco... why are we in your room?"
    sean Concerned "Rocco……我們怎麼會出現在你的房間裡？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4656
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_a3b9b0dc:

    # narrator Embarrassed "I feel bad waking her up in the middle of the night."
    narrator Embarrassed "半夜叫醒她，我有點過意不去。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4661
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_680bc3ac:

    # "Thankfully the hole isn't that far from home so I don't think it'll be too much trouble."
    "好在天坑離家不遠，也不至於太麻煩。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4664
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_7cc4f6dd:

    # narrator Neutral "All we really need her to do is shine a light at the cave entrance. Hopefully we'll be able to see it."
    narrator Neutral "她只需要在洞穴入口給我們照明就夠了。但願我們看得到。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4668
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_70c31b4b:

    # "The phone rings three times before she picks it up."
    "電話響了三聲她才接起。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4672
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_441183fe:

    # seanMom Happy "Hello?"
    seanMom Happy "喂？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4676
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_9fb0a36f:

    # sean "Hey mom it's me. I kinda snuck out of the house, and went into the hole with Rocco and A-Nora."
    sean "喂，媽，是我。我從家裡跑出來了，跟Rocco和A……Nora進了那個坑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4678
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_8f00fcc9:

    # sean "Hey mom it's me. I kinda snuck out of the house, and went into the hole with Rocco and Cody."
    sean "喂，媽，是我。我從家裡跑出來了，跟Rocco和Cody進了那個坑。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4681
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_9ddc4f02:

    # sean "Could you and Dad come grab us?"
    sean "你和爸能來接我們嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4688
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_1c023bdc:

    # seanMom Concerned "I-I'm sorry I think you have the wrong number."
    seanMom Concerned "不、不好意思，你應該是打錯號碼了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4693
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_cd8acb92:

    # sean "I-It's me... Sean... Your son?"
    sean "是、是我……Sean……你兒子？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4698
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_67b80d48:

    # seanMomVoice Quiet "No... I'm sorry sir, I don't know any Seans."
    seanMomVoice Quiet "不……對不起先生，我不認識叫Sean的人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4703
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_cfc5e65e:

    # sean "Oh... uuh... sorry for waking you up."
    sean "喔……呃……抱歉吵醒你了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4707
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_d9d1984c:

    # seanMomVoice "No worries. I hope you can get out sir."
    seanMomVoice "沒關係的。希望你出得去，先生。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4720
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_0d644ab2:

    # narrator Neutral "I make sure to open up Mom's contact, and call her from that."
    narrator Neutral "我確保開著的是媽媽的聯絡人頁面，從那裡打給她。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4721
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_bd18d53a:

    # "Once again the phone rings twice before it gets picked up."
    "電話再次響了兩聲才被接起。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4726
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_913754d9:

    # sean Concerned "Mom?"
    sean Concerned "媽？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4733
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_473385d9:

    # seanMomVoice Trauma "Nope, sorry sir... Wrong number."
    seanMomVoice Trauma "不，對不起先生……你打錯了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4740
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_dc4ac5bb:

    # sean Angry "But, this is the contact I have for her. You sound just like her!"
    sean Angry "但這是我從她的聯絡人頁面打的。你聲音跟她一模一樣！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4747
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_d7fc031d:

    # seanMomVoice Neutral "Well, does she live in Carthage? I might know her and can get you her number."
    seanMomVoice Neutral "呃，那她住在迦太基嗎？我說不定認識，能給你號碼。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4752
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_1101318f:

    # sean Concerned "Katherine Wright, do you know her?"
    sean Concerned "Katherine Wright，你認識她嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4755
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_ed1bd459:

    # "There's a pause that lasts too long."
    "停頓得過久了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4756
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_c89a7bc8:

    # narrator Trauma "Then the phone hangs up."
    narrator Trauma "然後電話掛斷了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4761
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_ba6a2dd4:

    # "Something is not right."
    "有什麼不對勁。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4762
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_eab05944:

    # "Should I call Mom again?"
    "我該再打給媽嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4774
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_94e8736c:

    # narrator Angry "Something is fucking wrong."
    narrator Angry "有什麼他媽的不對勁。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4775
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_61120e60:

    # narrator Neutral "I try calling Mom again and I get no answer."
    narrator Neutral "我再度試著打給媽，沒人接。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4776
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_0b027094:

    # narrator Angry "This has to be her."
    narrator Angry "這必須是她。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4777
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_5a411bb2:

    # narrator Concerned "Why doesn't she recognize me, she's my mom! I press the call again and get no answer."
    narrator Concerned "她怎麼會不認識我，她是我媽耶！我再按通話，還是沒人接。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4780
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_d90793e4:

    # narrator Neutral "I manually dial her number, triple checking that I got every character correct, and I still get no response."
    narrator Neutral "我手動撥她的號碼，確認三次每個數字都是正確的，還是沒回應。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4783
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_a6c3ad01:

    # "It isn't until my fourth call that it goes through."
    "直到第四次才接通。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4786
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_a9dac6e9:

    # sean Concerned "Mom plea-"
    sean Concerned "媽，求——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4791
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_2f795ecc:

    # seanDadVoice Trauma "I don't know who you are, but you better stop calling this instant or I'll be contacting the police!"
    seanDadVoice Trauma "我不知道你是誰，但你最好別再打來了，不然我就報警！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4794
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_cb3ebda6:

    # "I hear weeping in the background."
    "背景有哭泣聲。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4798
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_020b21e4:

    # sean Crying "Dad-"
    sean Crying "爸——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4803
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_e3c4d808:

    # seanDadVoice "We ain't got no kid! Now stop botherin' us!"
    seanDadVoice "我們沒有孩子！別再煩我們了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4809
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_ddd2a9df:

    # "The phone hangs up."
    "電話掛斷了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4810
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_67208de5:

    # "I just sit there. Trying to compose myself."
    "我呆坐原地，試圖平復心情。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4825
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_b9259ed3:

    # narrator Embarrassed "I feel bad waking him up in the middle of the night."
    narrator Embarrassed "半夜叫醒他，我有點過意不去。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4828
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_f93b7e28:

    # narrator Neutral "Thankfully he is kind of used to it. He'd have weekends where he'd be on call for late night repairs."
    narrator Neutral "幸好他還算習慣了。他週末有時候會值班做深夜維修。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4831
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_8f8b398d:

    # narrator Embarrassed "One night he caught me sneaking out as he was heading to a call."
    narrator Embarrassed "有一晚，我在偷溜出去的時候，被正要接電話的他逮到了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4832
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_be3b6227:

    # "I told him it was to hang out with Casey, and he just winked saying that it'll be our little secret."
    "我告訴他是要去和Casey玩，他就眨眼說這是我們之間的小秘密。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4835
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_26b1b062:

    # narrator Neutral "That's probably when he figured out he had a gay son."
    narrator Neutral "他大概就是那時發覺自己兒子是gay的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4839
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_b05f6bf0:

    # "The phone rings twice before he picks up."
    "電話響了兩聲他才接起。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4843
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_e23cb0f2:

    # seanDad Happy "Yello."
    seanDad Happy "喂？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4849
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_97582bec:

    # sean "Hey Dad. A-Nora, Rocco, and I-"
    sean "嘿，爸。我和A……Nora還有Rocco——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4851
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_a792a592:

    # sean "Hey Dad. Cody, Rocco and I-"
    sean "嘿爸。我和Cody還有Rocco——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4858
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_6958245d:

    # seanDad Neutral "Sorry to interrupt, but I think you got the wrong number."
    seanDad Neutral "抱歉插個嘴，但我想你打錯號碼了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4861
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_85c725d4:

    # sean Concerned "I-I'm sorry?"
    sean Concerned "我、我什麼？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4868
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_de869138:

    # seanDadVoice "Yeah, I ain't got no kids. Maybe you dialed the number wrong."
    seanDadVoice "嗯，我沒有孩子。你恐怕是撥錯號碼了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4870
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_59e2048e:

    # narrator Embarrassed "I just called him off of my contact."
    narrator Embarrassed "我是從聯絡人打過去的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4871
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_5e2a2da3:

    # "Maybe Dad got a new number and forgot to tell me?"
    "是爸換了新號碼，然後忘了告訴我嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4874
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_132537f6:

    # narrator Scrutinizing "It's weird though. That voice sounds just like him."
    narrator Scrutinizing "不過很奇怪。對方的聲音跟他一模一樣。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4877
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_8e48c3e3:

    # sean Embarrassed "Sorry for bothering you. Have a good night."
    sean Embarrassed "抱歉打擾你了，晚安。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4880
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_29aa27ad:

    # seanDadVoice "You as well."
    seanDadVoice "你也是。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4882
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_0121ed92:

    # "He hangs up."
    "他掛斷了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4894
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_649a085c:

    # narrator Neutral "I go back to the contact and look it over."
    narrator Neutral "我回到聯絡人再檢查一次。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4897
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_857d0034:

    # narrator Concerned "Everything seems correct. Maybe it was just some glitch or something with the call."
    narrator Concerned "也沒哪裡不對。也許只是通話有點故障。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4898
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_e2621d54:

    # "I press the button again hoping that it goes to the right phone."
    "我又按了一次，希望能打通正確的電話。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4900
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_8b5c7bc6:

    # narrator Neutral "It rings once, twice, three times before it's picked up."
    narrator Neutral "響了一聲、兩聲、三聲才被接起。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4905
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_37a83122:

    # sean Happy "Dad-"
    sean Happy "爸——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4912
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_1021239d:

    # seanDadVoice Neutral "Nope wrong number again."
    seanDadVoice Neutral "不是，你又打錯了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4919
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_5f51923d:

    # sean Angry "Wait! Are you in Carthage?"
    sean Angry "等等！你在迦太基嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4924
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_e147276a:

    # narrator Concerned "There's a pause."
    narrator Concerned "有一段停頓。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4930
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_5e584a82:

    # seanDadVoice "Yes."
    seanDadVoice "對。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4935
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_584bed52:

    # sean "Do you know Warren Wright?"
    sean "你認識Warren Wright嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4940
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_ca8998c7:

    # "There's a suspicious tone to the voice."
    "他語帶遲疑："

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4944
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_d6769bf9:

    # seanDad Angry "I am him."
    seanDad Angry "我就是。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4947
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_0e59bfff:

    # sean "Dad this is serious!"
    sean "爸，現在情況很嚴重的！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4951
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_7f7495c5:

    # sean Neutral "Nora, Rocco, and I are stuck in the hole! Can you please come over and help get us out."
    sean Neutral "我跟Nora和Rocco被困在坑裡了！你能來救我們出去嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4953
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_bd5e52a0:

    # sean Neutral "Cody, Rocco, and I are stuck in the hole! Can you please come over and help get us out."
    sean Neutral "我跟Cody和Rocco被困在坑裡了！你能來救我們出去嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4958
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_0de10dac:

    # seanDad Angry "I-I'm sorry you've mistaken me for someone else."
    seanDad Angry "不、不好意思，你認錯人了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4960
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_7685814b:

    # "And the phone hangs up."
    "然後電話掛斷了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4972
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_efa29930:

    # narrator Neutral "I look over the number again and again."
    narrator Neutral "我一遍遍地看著號碼。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4976
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_efc848e6:

    # narrator Angry "It's right, I'm sure it is! I dial it into the keypad making sure each number matches."
    narrator Angry "我很確定沒錯！我撥進鍵盤後，確認每個數字都符合。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4977
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_45aa0851:

    # narrator Neutral "It rings five times before going to voice mail."
    narrator Neutral "響了五聲後轉進語音信箱。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4980
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_9f543184:

    # "I call it again, three times before voice mail."
    "我再打一次，三聲後就轉進語音信箱。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4985
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_e82b6826:

    # narrator Angry "One ring is all I get."
    narrator Angry "這次只響了一聲。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4989
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_a2db3316:

    # narrator Neutral "I try one more time, and he picks up."
    narrator Neutral "我又再試一次，他接了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4992
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_48e97c53:

    # seanDad Scared "Call me one more time kid, I swear!"
    seanDad Scared "你再打一次看看，我操！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:4999
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_896305a0:

    # sean "Dad-"
    sean "爸——"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5002
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_aad64ba5:

    # seanDad Trauma "Fine! Ya know what. You said you's in the hole right?"
    seanDad Trauma "好啦！這樣吧，你說你在坑裡是不？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5005
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_049da45f:

    # seanDad "I call the cops and get a restrainin' order so you can get out of it, and my life!"
    seanDad "我去報警申請禁制令，你就能離開那坑洞和我的生活了！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5008
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_fdef588b:

    # seanDad "What's your last name Sean!"
    seanDad "你姓什麼，Sean！？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5013
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_53e330a0:

    # sean Quiet "I never told you my first name."
    sean Quiet "我沒跟你說過我的名字。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5018
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_52532839:

    # "He stops for a moment."
    "他頓了一下。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5024
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_5095ca62:

    # seanDad "I's got your contact for some reason. Don't know why!"
    seanDad "我不知道為什麼，有你的聯絡人！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5029
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_51b9b60b:

    # sean "Dad...{nw}"
    sean "爸……{nw}"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5034
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_c81d8a65:

    # sean Angry "Dad...{fast} I'm your son! Sean Wright!"
    sean Angry "爸……{fast}我是你兒子啊！Sean Wright！"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5039
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_8c92717e:

    # seanDad Trauma "I ain't got no son. Never had one."
    seanDad Trauma "我沒有兒子。從來沒有。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5040
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_dce396a7:

    # seanDad "Look I'll get the cops comin' to ya. Jus' please stop callin."
    seanDad "行了，我會叫警察去找你。求你別再打了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5044
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_ed48b0b5:

    # "He hangs up..."
    "他掛斷了……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5045
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_67208de5_1:

    # "I just sit there. Trying to compose myself."
    "我呆坐原地，試圖平復心情。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5059
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_1cb93774:

    # narrator Neutral "My phone rings a few times before a tired voice picks up."
    narrator Neutral "我的電話響了幾次，一道疲憊的聲音接起。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5061
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_a1014455:

    # operator "9-1-1 what's your emergency?"
    operator "911，請問有什麼緊急情況？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5066
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_c45b54b6:

    # sean Happy "Hi, some friends and I went into the hole in Carthage, and now we can't find our way out."
    sean Happy "你好，我和幾個朋友進了迦太基的天坑，現在找不到路出去了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5071
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_1e5602b4:

    # operator "Understood. Please stay where you are and we'll get help to you as soon as we can."
    operator "了解。請待在原地，我們會盡快派人過去。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5076
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_68f1ecc8:

    # sean Neutral "Do you have an E.T.A. on that?"
    sean Neutral "有預計到達時間嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5079
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_c53bfd4a:

    # operator "It will probably be some time around noon tomorrow."
    operator "大概明天中午左右吧。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5084
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_c2f1df45:

    # sean "Noon tomorrow?"
    sean "明天中午？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5089
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_007300a0:

    # operator "Yes sir. This isn't the first call we've received this hour."
    operator "是的，先生。你不是第一個在這時間打來的了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5092
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_2845ad99:

    # sean "Ok... thanks..."
    sean "好的……謝謝……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5097
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_464eb196:

    # operator "Is there anything I can do for you sir?"
    operator "還有什麼需要幫忙的嗎，先生？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5102
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_a2fe5f89:

    # sean Concerned "No I guess..."
    sean Concerned "應該沒了吧……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5103
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_fec47ed0:

    # sean "Don't you have anyone that can come earlier than that?"
    sean "沒人能更快趕來嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5106
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_11f11386:

    # operator Neutral "Our system shows that every available unit, police, ambulance, firetruck, or search and rescue vehicle within a 100 mile radius of Carthage has been dispatched to the hole."
    operator Neutral "我們的系統顯示，迦太基方圓一百英里內所有可調度單位，警察、救護車、消防車或搜救車輛都已派遣到天坑了。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5107
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_a577025a:

    # operator "I would recommend staying where you are. It is more likely that someone will find you."
    operator "我建議你們待在原地。被人找到的機率比較高。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5110
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_a2c80a81:

    # sean Concerned "Ok... you're not going to ask for any landmarks to help locate me?"
    sean Concerned "好的……你不問有什麼地標來幫住定位嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5115
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_0bf37a47:

    # operator "Do you see anything other than the darkness?"
    operator "你們除了黑暗還能看得到什麼嗎？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5118
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_5f2cfc7b:

    # sean Neutral "No..."
    sean Neutral "不能……"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5121
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_2929fcb7:

    # operator "Then please stay where you are sir. Help will arrive."
    operator "那就請待在原地吧，先生。救援會過去的。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5125
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_08dd5ba1:

    # "I hang up the phone and look at the others."
    "我掛斷電話，看向其他人。"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5138
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_f1d11510:

    # "Maybe Blake is up?"
    "也許Blake還醒著？"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5167
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_76b2fe88:

    # nvl clear
    nvl clear

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5174
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_4292370f:

    # seanPhone Happy "u up? Need hlep"
    seanPhone Happy "在嗎？我需要幫助"

# game/sean12202024.rpy:5179
translate Tchinese seanWhoToCall12202024_346c1b81:

